�研究通过结构化搜索PubMed、Europe PMC等数据库并结合引文追踪，筛选出15项主要临床研究进行主题合成。文章未进行定量荟萃分析，而是从响应表型、生态干扰（如抗生素/益生菌暴露）和治疗性工程化（如FMT、饮食干预）三个主题出发，评估微生物组调节的机制合理性与临床可行性。\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"Ch7\"\n      ],\n      \"unit_links\": [\n        {\n          \"chapter_id\": \"Ch7\",\n          \"unit_id\": \"Ch7_U01\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"chapter_id\": \"Ch7\",\n          \"unit_id\": \"Ch7_U03\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"review_source_handles\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0055\",\n      \"identity\": {\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0055\",\n        \"source_id\": \"source::P0055\",\n        \"aliases\": [],\n        \"title\": \"Exploring the emerging role of the microbiome in cancer immunotherapy\",\n        \"doi\": \"10.1186/s40425-019-0574-4\",\n        \"paper_id\": \"17645c18ad4a63e464eb9c3cce695bc24d99a1df\",\n        \"year\": \"2019\",\n        \"canonical_paper_id\": null\n      },\n      \"source_types\": [\n        {\n          \"field\": \"study_summary_A.paper_kind\",\n          \"value\": \"review\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"content_clues\": [\n        {\n          \"field\": \"study_summary_A.work_summary\",\n          \"value\": \"本文是一篇综述，系统梳理了肠道微生物群如何影响癌症免疫治疗的疗效。文章首先介绍了宿主-微生物相互作用的基础研究方法（如16S rRNA测序、宏基因组测序及无菌/悉生小鼠模型的使用及其局限性），随后总结了证明肠道菌群组成与免疫治疗疗效存在因果联系的关键实验证据（包括动物模型中的定植实验和人类队列的相关性研究）。接着，文章详细探讨了可能的生物学机制，包括活细菌或微生物相关分子模式（MAMPs/PAMPs）作为信使通过增强抗原性、佐剂效应或旁观者激活来调节抗肿瘤免疫，以及微生物代谢物（如短链脂肪酸）和宿主细胞因子作为信使的作用。最后，文章讨论了将微生物组作为预后生物标志物、谨慎使用抗生素以及开发基于微生物组的干预策略（如FMT、益生菌、噬菌体疗法）的临床前景，并指出了当前研究的局限性和未来方向。\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"Ch7\"\n      ],\n      \"unit_links\": [\n        {\n          \"chapter_id\": \"Ch7\",\n          \"unit_id\": \"Ch7_U01\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"review_source_handles\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0295\",\n      \"identity\": {\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0295\",\n        \"source_id\": \"source::P0295\",\n        \"aliases\": [],\n        \"title\": \"Checkpoint inhibitor responses can be regulated by the gut microbiota – A systematic review\",\n        \"doi\": \"10.1016/j.neo.2023.100923\",\n        \"paper_id\": \"8171fbde7084a1b5b6311504ed716c3a29b3797e\",\n        \"year\": \"2023\",\n        \"canonical_paper_id\": null\n      },\n      \"source_types\": [\n        {\n          \"field\": \"study_summary_A.paper_kind\",\n          \"value\": \"review\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"content_clues\": [\n        {\n          \"field\": \"study_summary_A.work_summary\",\n          \"value\": \"这是一篇2023年发表的系统综述，旨在调查肠道微生物群作为预测生物标志物的潜力。作者遵循PRISMA指南，检索了EMBASE、Medline和Cochrane Library数据库，筛选出18项涉及775名实体瘤患者的队列研究。由于各研究在测序方法（16S rRNA、宏基因组鸟枪法测序等）、癌症类型及反应定义上的异质性，无法进行定量荟萃分析，因此采用定性叙事综合的方法。研究识别出与良好预后（响应者）和不良预后（无响应者）相关的特定细菌物种，并讨论了不同技术方法和混杂因素对结果解释的影响。\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"Ch7\"\n      ],\n      \"unit_links\": [\n        {\n          \"chapter_id\": \"Ch7\",\n          \"unit_id\": \"Ch7_U01\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"review_source_handles\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0302\",\n      \"identity\": {\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0302\",\n        \"source_id\": \"source::P0302\",\n        \"aliases\": [],\n        \"title\": \"Salivary microbiome changes distinguish response to chemoradiotherapy in patients with oral cancer\",\n        \"doi\": \"10.1186/s40168-023-01677-w\",\n        \"paper_id\": \"83ee66187aff0ae19e2706481c06aa696e21465b\",\n        \"year\": \"2023\",\n        \"canonical_paper_id\": null\n      },\n      \"source_types\": [\n        {\n          \"field\": \"study_summary_A.paper_kind\",\n          \"value\": \"empirical\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"content_clues\": [\n        {\n          \"field\": \"study_summary_A.work_summary\",\n          \"value\": \"本研究是一项针对口腔鳞状细胞癌（SCC）患者的纵向研究，旨在探讨癌症治疗对唾液微生物组的影响，并考察这些变化与治疗反应及唾液抗菌蛋白DMBT1表达之间的关联。研究纳入了接受不同治疗方案（化疗放疗、单纯手术等）的患者，通过16S rRNA基因测序分析基线（0个月）和治疗后（6个月）的唾液样本。结果显示，治疗后唾液微生物组的丰富度和多样性普遍降低，且特定菌群结构发生显著变化。在化疗放疗患者中，响应者与未响应者在治疗前后的微生物组成存在差异，其中Prevotella属与非响应相关，而Gemella属等与响应相关。此外，研究发现SCC会抑制唾液DMBT1的表达，治疗后DMBT1水平回升，且DMBT1水平的增加与Gemella等特定菌群的丰度增加呈正相关。该研究首次在同一队列中纵向追踪了SCC治疗引起的唾液微生物组变化及其与宿主免疫蛋白表达的关联。\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"Ch7\"\n      ],\n      \"unit_links\": [\n        {\n          \"chapter_id\": \"Ch7\",\n          \"unit_id\": \"Ch7_U01\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"review_source_handles\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0354\",\n      \"identity\": {\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0354\",\n        \"source_id\": \"source::P0354\",\n        \"aliases\": [],\n        \"title\": \"A uniform computational approach improved on existing pipelines to reveal microbiome biomarkers of non-response to immune checkpoint inhibitors\",\n        \"doi\": \"10.1158/1078-0432.ccr-20-4834\",\n        \"paper_id\": \"9ab8366e1190d9c05b04e4dcee48581a8e9c0db5\",\n        \"year\": \"2021\",\n        \"canonical_paper_id\": null\n      },\n      \"source_types\": [\n        {\n          \"field\": \"study_summary_A.paper_kind\",\n          \"value\": \"empirical\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"content_clues\": [\n        {\n          \"field\": \"study_summary_A.work_summary\",\n          \"value\": \"This empirical study addresses the inconsistency in microbial biomarkers for ICI efficacy across previous small-scale studies by applying a uniform computational pipeline to reanalyze raw sequencing data from multiple cohorts. The authors identified novel bacterial signatures associated with responders (R) and non-responders (NR), developed an integrated microbiome prediction index, and found that signals associated with non-response were stronger and more consistent than those for response. The study highlights the potential of NR-associated indices to identify patients who might benefit from microbiome-based interventions.\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"Ch7\"\n      ],\n      \"unit_links\": [\n        {\n          \"chapter_id\": \"Ch7\",\n          \"unit_id\": \"Ch7_U01\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"review_source_handles\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0264\",\n      \"identity\": {\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0264\",\n        \"source_id\": \"source::P0264\",\n        \"aliases\": [],\n        \"title\": \"Systematic evaluation of immune regulation and modulation\",\n        \"doi\": \"10.1186/s40425-017-0223-8\",\n        \"paper_id\": \"705d021ac660029794f037498bc1ffea03cbe239\",\n        \"year\": \"2017\",\n        \"canonical_paper_id\": null\n      },\n      \"source_types\": [\n        {\n          \"field\": \"study_summary_A.paper_kind\",\n          \"value\": \"review\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"content_clues\": [\n        {\n          \"field\": \"study_summary_A.work_summary\",\n          \"value\": \"本文是Society for Immunotherapy of Cancer (SITC)免疫生物标志物工作组第3工作组（WG3）发布的综述，旨在为癌症免疫治疗的免疫监测提供系统性评估和建议。文章讨论了不同生物样本（血液、组织、骨髓、微生物组、输入细胞）在免疫治疗背景下的独特采集和处理要求，介绍了用于评估潜在生物标志物的高通量检测方法（如流式细胞术、质谱、测序、蛋白阵列等），并提出了整合多平台异构数据以分析系统性宿主反应的分析框架。\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"Ch7\"\n      ],\n      \"unit_links\": [\n        {\n          \"chapter_id\": \"Ch7\",\n          \"unit_id\": \"Ch7_U01\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"review_source_handles\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0436\",\n      \"identity\": {\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0436\",\n        \"source_id\": \"source::P0436\",\n        \"aliases\": [],\n        \"title\": \"Abstract 6699: Delineating germline, tumor and extrinsic factors driving mucosal melanoma (MM) risk and response to immune checkpoint inhibitor (ICI) treatment\",\n        \"doi\": \"10.1158/1538-7445.am2024-6699\",\n        \"paper_id\": \"bf7682bc64d82a0342f438a261f4ce8de81ed9c0\",\n        \"year\": \"2024\",\n        \"canonical_paper_id\": null\n      },\n      \"source_types\": [\n        {\n          \"field\": \"study_summary_A.paper_kind\",\n          \"value\": \"empirical\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"content_clues\": [\n        {\n          \"field\": \"study_summary_A.work_summary\",\n          \"value\": \"该论文介绍了一项针对罕见且生物学特性独特的黏膜黑色素瘤（MM）的前瞻性、统一且全面的队列研究。鉴于MM具有低免疫原性和低肿瘤突变负荷，其对免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）的反应率较低，本研究旨在通过多组学 profiling 确定分子变异、种系易感性、宿主免疫、微生物组（肠道、黏膜和肿瘤）以及可改变风险因素与晚期MM中ICI反应和耐药性之间的相互作用。目前处于数据收集和初步分析阶段，已入组98名患者，并建立了包括PDX模型和细胞系在内的生物样本库。\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"Ch7\"\n      ],\n      \"unit_links\": [\n        {\n          \"chapter_id\": \"Ch7\",\n          \"unit_id\": \"Ch7_U01\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"review_source_handles\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0367\",\n      \"identity\": {\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0367\",\n        \"source_id\": \"source::P0367\",\n        \"aliases\": [],\n        \"title\": \"Coupling culturomics and metagenomics sequencing to characterize the gut microbiome of patients with cancer treated with immune checkpoint inhibitors\",\n        \"doi\": \"10.1186/s13099-025-00694-4\",\n        \"paper_id\": \"9e9bf2bb52117d8548594524043c72e02b8754d7\",\n        \"year\": \"2025\",\n        \"canonical_paper_id\": null\n      },\n      \"source_types\": [\n        {\n          \"field\": \"study_summary_A.paper_kind\",\n          \"value\": \"empirical\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"content_clues\": [\n        {\n          \"field\": \"study_summary_A.work_summary\",\n          \"value\": \"本研究旨在通过结合高通量培养组学（culturomics）和宏基因组测序，全面表征接受ICI治疗的癌症患者的肠道微生物组，以克服单一技术的局限性。研究对22名癌症患者和7名健康志愿者的粪便样本进行了培养分离和宏基因组分析。结果显示，健康志愿者的物种丰富度显著高于癌症患者，且两组在β多样性上存在显著差异。在临床结果方面，非响应者中富集了Enterocloster属、Hungatella hathewayi和Cutibacterium acnes，而响应者中则主要富集Bacteroides属。此外，宏基因组测序在NSCLC患者中识别出94种仅由培养组学检测到的独特物种，证实了两种方法的互补性。\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"Ch7\"\n      ],\n      \"unit_links\": [\n        {\n          \"chapter_id\": \"Ch7\",\n          \"unit_id\": \"Ch7_U01\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"review_source_handles\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0566\",\n      \"identity\": {\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0566\",\n        \"source_id\": \"source::P0566\",\n        \"aliases\": [],\n        \"title\": \"Microbiome as a prediction of immunotherapy response in lung cancer\",\n        \"doi\": \"10.3389/fimmu.2026.1849553\",\n        \"paper_id\": \"f9ac47c0add070f4c39ec8ed763518f941ddf164\",\n        \"year\": \"2026\",\n        \"canonical_paper_id\": null\n      },\n      \"source_types\": [\n        {\n          \"field\": \"study_summary_A.paper_kind\",\n          \"value\": \"review\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"content_clues\": [\n        {\n          \"field\": \"study_summary_A.work_summary\",\n          \"value\": \"这是一篇叙事性综述，旨在综合评估微生物组作为肺癌免疫治疗疗效和毒性预测生物标志物的证据。文章系统梳理了肠道和口腔微生物组在 ICI 治疗中的角色，重点分析了特定菌属（如 Akkermansia muciniphila）、微生物多样性及代谢产物（如短链脂肪酸、肌苷）与无进展生存期（PFS）和总生存期（OS）的关联。同时，综述讨论了抗生素和质子泵抑制剂（PPI）对微生物组的破坏作用及其对预后的负面影响，并探讨了从单一物种标记向复合评分模型转变的趋势，以及粪菌移植（FMT）等干预策略的早期临床数据。\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"Ch7\"\n      ],\n      \"unit_links\": [\n        {\n          \"chapter_id\": \"Ch7\",\n          \"unit_id\": \"Ch7_U01\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"review_source_handles\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0031\",\n      \"identity\": {\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0031\",\n        \"source_id\": \"source::P0031\",\n        \"aliases\": [],\n        \"title\": \"The Human Microbiome: A New Frontier in Precision Medicine\",\n        \"doi\": \"10.3329/kyamcj.v16i2.87129\",\n        \"paper_id\": \"0e5457d6a79da1b3da21b718c8a0e5c0dc6f4128\",\n        \"year\": \"2026\",\n        \"canonical_paper_id\": null\n      },\n      \"source_types\": [\n        {\n          \"field\": \"study_summary_A.paper_kind\",\n          \"value\": \"perspective\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"content_clues\": [\n        {\n          \"field\": \"study_summary_A.work_summary\",\n          \"value\": \"本文是一篇编辑引言/观点文章，旨在探讨人类微生物组如何作为精准医学的新前沿重塑疾病病理学理解及个性化医疗策略。文章指出微生物组不仅是健康的被动反映者，更是代谢、免疫和药物反应等关键功能的动态参与者。作者综述了微生物组在早期诊断生物标志物开发、药代动力学影响（Pharmacomicrobiomics）、以及通过粪菌移植（FMT）或定制益生菌进行干预方面的潜力，同时分析了将其整合到临床实践中面临的标准化、因果推断、数据隐私及监管挑战，并展望了多组学联合与人工智能驱动的未来方向。\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"Ch7\"\n      ],\n      \"unit_links\": [\n        {\n          \"chapter_id\": \"Ch7\",\n          \"unit_id\": \"Ch7_U02\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"review_source_handles\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0433\",\n      \"identity\": {\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0433\",\n        \"source_id\": \"source::P0433\",\n        \"aliases\": [],\n        \"title\": \"The relationship between gut microbiota and cancer immune response and immunotherapy\",\n        \"doi\": \"10.3389/fimmu.2026.1833138\",\n        \"paper_id\": \"bc91801a5c66e51692a6a2715059a28b27328e39\",\n        \"year\": \"2026\",\n        \"canonical_paper_id\": null\n      },\n      \"source_types\": [\n        {\n          \"field\": \"study_summary_A.paper_kind\",\n          \"value\": \"review\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"content_clues\": [\n        {\n          \"field\": \"study_summary_A.work_summary\",\n          \"value\": \"本文是一篇综述，系统阐述了肠道微生物群如何通过复杂的生物双向相互作用调节癌症免疫和免疫治疗结果。文章首先介绍了肠道作为最大免疫器官的背景，随后详细分析了微生物群通过模式识别受体信号传导和表观遗传调控影响先天免疫（如巨噬细胞、树突状细胞）、适应性免疫（T细胞、NK细胞）及固有淋巴细胞的机制。重点讨论了短链脂肪酸（SCFAs）、肌苷、氧化三甲胺（TMAO）、色氨酸衍生物和胆汁酸等关键微生物代谢物在驱动免疫细胞分化和活性中的作用。此外，综述评估了粪菌移植（FMT）、益生菌、益生元和饮食干预等治疗策略在增强ICI疗效和管理irAEs方面的潜力与挑战，并指出了当前研究在标准化、定植效率及因果机制验证方面的局限性。\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"Ch7\"\n      ],\n      \"unit_links\": [\n        {\n          \"chapter_id\": \"Ch7\",\n          \"unit_id\": \"Ch7_U02\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"review_source_handles\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0561\",\n      \"identity\": {\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0561\",\n        \"source_id\": \"source::P0561\",\n        \"aliases\": [],\n        \"title\": \"Tumour neoantigen mimicry by microbial species in cancer immunotherapy\",\n        \"doi\": \"10.1038/s41416-021-01365-2\",\n        \"paper_id\": \"f845fe79c73bf04f15c7ab75115b887691b09e53\",\n        \"year\": \"2021\",\n        \"canonical_paper_id\": null\n      },\n      \"source_types\": [\n        {\n          \"field\": \"study_summary_A.paper_kind\",\n          \"value\": \"review\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"content_clues\": [\n        {\n          \"field\": \"study_summary_A.work_summary\",\n          \"value\": \"本文是一篇综述文章，旨在阐述肿瘤新抗原在癌症免疫治疗中的核心作用，并重点探讨由肠道及额外肠道微生物物种通过自然基因表达程序产生的、与肿瘤新抗原相似的表位（即分子模拟）如何影响宿主抗肿瘤免疫反应。文章指出，这种微生物介导的新抗原模拟可能是解释为何部分患者对免疫检查点阻断疗法产生长期有利反应而其他患者无反应的关键机制之一。文章梳理了现有证据，提出了该假说的生物学基础，并设计了未来验证这一机制的实验策略。\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"Ch7\"\n      ],\n      \"unit_links\": [\n        {\n          \"chapter_id\": \"Ch7\",\n          \"unit_id\": \"Ch7_U02\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"review_source_handles\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0012\",\n      \"identity\": {\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0012\",\n        \"source_id\": \"source::P0012\",\n        \"aliases\": [],\n        \"title\": \"Antibiotic use reduces efficacy of tyrosine kinase inhibitors in patients with advanced melanoma and non-small-cell lung cancer\",\n        \"doi\": \"10.1016/j.esmoop.2022.100430\",\n        \"paper_id\": \"04d758358071fe0987733466b05a84fae0fcde9f\",\n        \"year\": \"2021\",\n        \"canonical_paper_id\": null\n      },\n      \"source_types\": [\n        {\n          \"field\": \"study_summary_A.paper_kind\",\n          \"value\": \"empirical\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"content_clues\": [\n        {\n          \"field\": \"study_summary_A.work_summary\",\n          \"value\": \"本研究旨在探讨抗生素（ABX）使用对接受靶向治疗（TKI）的晚期实体瘤患者疗效的影响。鉴于既往研究显示抗生素通过破坏肠道菌群可能降低免疫检查点抑制剂和化疗的疗效，但其在TKI治疗中的作用尚不明确，作者利用回顾性临床数据，比较了在使用TKI前后特定时间窗内使用抗生素与未使用抗生素患者的无进展生存期（PFS）和总生存期（OS）。研究纳入了168名可评估患者，通过多变量分析调整混杂因素后，发现抗生素使用与较短的PFS和OS独立相关，且这种负面影响在体能状态较差的患者中更为显著。\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"Ch7\"\n      ],\n      \"unit_links\": [\n        {\n          \"chapter_id\": \"Ch7\",\n          \"unit_id\": \"Ch7_U02\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"review_source_handles\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0171\",\n      \"identity\": {\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0171\",\n        \"source_id\": \"source::P0171\",\n        \"aliases\": [],\n        \"title\": \"The gut microbiome and response to immune checkpoint inhibitors: preclinical and clinical strategies\",\n        \"doi\": \"10.1186/s40169-019-0225-x\",\n        \"paper_id\": \"4a591a61cf38dfbee4d07bbc7e8f7596d3f104b5\",\n        \"year\": \"2019\",\n        \"canonical_paper_id\": null\n      },\n      \"source_types\": [\n        {\n          \"field\": \"study_summary_A.paper_kind\",\n          \"value\": \"review\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"content_clues\": [\n        {\n          \"field\": \"study_summary_A.work_summary\",\n          \"value\": \"本文是一篇系统性综述，旨在评估肠道微生物组作为预测免疫检查点抑制剂疗效生物标志物的潜力。作者综合了已发表的临床前研究和临床研究结果，详细列举了与ICIs疗效正相关或负相关的特定细菌物种及分类群。文章不仅总结了微生物组影响抗肿瘤免疫反应的潜在机制（如树突状细胞成熟、T细胞浸润等），还深入探讨了临床前与临床研究之间发现的不一致性问题，分析了导致这些差异的可能原因（如宿主-微生物生态系统的复杂性、采样与分析方法的标准化不足等），并提出了未来建立可靠生物标志物所需的研究方向和方法学改进建议。\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"Ch7\"\n      ],\n      \"unit_links\": [\n        {\n          \"chapter_id\": \"Ch7\",\n          \"unit_id\": \"Ch7_U02\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"review_source_handles\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0375\",\n      \"identity\": {\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0375\",\n        \"source_id\": \"source::P0375\",\n        \"aliases\": [],\n        \"title\": \"Chronic Inflammatory Diseases: Are We Ready for Microbiota-based Dietary Intervention?\",\n        \"doi\": \"10.1016/j.jcmgh.2019.02.008\",\n        \"paper_id\": \"a23415cfd3d02f562c74b0a4d6569499690c5ecb\",\n        \"year\": \"2019\",\n        \"canonical_paper_id\": null\n      },\n      \"source_types\": [\n        {\n          \"field\": \"study_summary_A.paper_kind\",\n          \"value\": \"review\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"content_clues\": [\n        {\n          \"field\": \"study_summary_A.work_summary\",\n          \"value\": \"本文是一篇综述，旨在回答“我们是否准备好使用基于肠道微生物群组成的个性化饮食干预来治疗慢性炎症性疾病？”这一问题。文章首先概述了非遗传因素（如饮食成分）对肠道微生物群及宿主炎症的影响，随后通过癌症免疫治疗、乳化剂研究、患者队列研究、可溶性纤维研究以及人群基础研究的案例，论证了个体间微生物群差异对干预结果的决定性作用。作者指出，尽管目前已有证据表明微生物群可以预测药物疗效和饮食反应，但由于细菌物种关联的不一致性、检测方法的局限性以及机制的复杂性，完全个性化的临床实施仍面临挑战。文章建议将粪便采样纳入常规临床试验，并探索更精细的微生物分析手段以识别“抗性”和“易感”个体。\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"Ch7\"\n      ],\n      \"unit_links\": [\n        {\n          \"chapter_id\": \"Ch7\",\n          \"unit_id\": \"Ch7_U02\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"review_source_handles\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0558\",\n      \"identity\": {\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0558\",\n        \"source_id\": \"source::P0558\",\n        \"aliases\": [],\n        \"title\": \"Overall survival according to timing of immune checkpoint inhibitors administration in patients with advanced cancer: Results from a large single-centre cohort analysis.\",\n        \"doi\": \"10.1200/jco.2025.43.16_suppl.2662\",\n        \"paper_id\": \"f7345b03e8a5419417513da6cf1833522f3be7ed\",\n        \"year\": \"2025\",\n        \"canonical_paper_id\": null\n      },\n      \"source_types\": [\n        {\n          \"field\": \"study_summary_A.paper_kind\",\n          \"value\": \"empirical\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"content_clues\": [\n        {\n          \"field\": \"study_summary_A.work_summary\",\n          \"value\": \"This study investigates whether the timing of ICI administration influences overall survival (OS), based on evidence of circadian dependence in the immune system. Using a large single-centre cohort of 2631 patients, the authors compared outcomes between 'early' and 'late' treatment groups, defined by whether ≥50% of cycles were administered after the median infusion time. The analysis employed Cox models with and without time-dependent variables to mitigate immortal time bias, adjusting for age, sex, ECOG status, cancer type, and treatment regimen.\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"Ch7\"\n      ],\n      \"unit_links\": [\n        {\n          \"chapter_id\": \"Ch7\",\n          \"unit_id\": \"Ch7_U02\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"review_source_handles\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0229\",\n      \"identity\": {\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0229\",\n        \"source_id\": \"source::P0229\",\n        \"aliases\": [],\n        \"title\": \"The role of gut microbiota in cancer treatment: friend or foe?\",\n        \"doi\": \"10.1136/gutjnl-2020-321153\",\n        \"paper_id\": \"5f8d3d58386a82442ee54bfba0610c6f19211eff\",\n        \"year\": \"2020\",\n        \"canonical_paper_id\": null\n      },\n      \"source_types\": [\n        {\n          \"field\": \"study_summary_A.paper_kind\",\n          \"value\": \"review\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"content_clues\": [\n        {\n          \"field\": \"study_summary_A.work_summary\",\n          \"value\": \"本文是一篇综述，系统梳理了肠道微生物群与癌症治疗之间的相互作用。文章首先阐述了微生物群失调如何促进肿瘤发生（如幽门螺杆菌、具核梭杆菌等），随后重点讨论了不同细菌物种如何通过代谢药物、调节免疫反应或诱导耐药性来影响化疗和免疫治疗的疗效。此外，综述还评估了利用微生物特征作为诊断/预后标志物的潜力，探讨了通过抗生素、益生菌、FMT和新型纳米技术/噬菌体疗法调控微生物群以增强疗效或减轻毒性的策略，并指出了当前研究在因果机制验证、动物模型外推性及临床转化方面的局限性。\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"Ch7\"\n      ],\n      \"unit_links\": [\n        {\n          \"chapter_id\": \"Ch7\",\n          \"unit_id\": \"Ch7_U02\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"review_source_handles\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0525\",\n      \"identity\": {\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0525\",\n        \"source_id\": \"source::P0525\",\n        \"aliases\": [],\n        \"title\": \"Modeling the effect of gut microbiome on therapeutic efficacy of immune checkpoint inhibitors against cancer.\",\n        \"doi\": \"10.1016/j.mbs.2022.108868\",\n        \"paper_id\": \"eb9e42baf491ed68233c52dcfe94004d813bb12b\",\n        \"year\": \"2022\",\n        \"canonical_paper_id\": null\n      },\n      \"source_types\": [\n        {\n          \"field\": \"study_summary_A.paper_kind\",\n          \"value\": \"theory\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"content_clues\": [\n        {\n          \"field\": \"study_summary_A.work_summary\",\n          \"value\": \"This paper addresses the heterogeneity in patient responses to immune checkpoint inhibitors (ICIs) by exploring how the gut microbiome influences therapeutic outcomes. The authors developed a mathematical model to simulate tumor-immune-gut microbiome interactions. They fitted the dynamics of gut bacteria to clinical data from melanoma patients and generated virtual patient datasets based on survival statistics. The study aimed to identify predictive markers for responders versus non-responders and to evaluate whether manipulating gut bacterial composition could improve response rates. The work provides a computational framework to understand mechanisms that are not fully explained by empirical studies alone.\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"Ch7\"\n      ],\n      \"unit_links\": [\n        {\n          \"chapter_id\": \"Ch7\",\n          \"unit_id\": \"Ch7_U02\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"review_source_handles\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0024\",\n      \"identity\": {\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0024\",\n        \"source_id\": \"source::P0024\",\n        \"aliases\": [],\n        \"title\": \"The human gut microbiome and its metabolic pathway dynamics before and during HIV antiretroviral therapy\",\n        \"doi\": \"10.1128/spectrum.02205-24\",\n        \"paper_id\": \"0ccad85a9f6c41d50296628847b3ffd3596af8ee\",\n        \"year\": \"2025\",\n        \"canonical_paper_id\": null\n      },\n      \"source_types\": [\n        {\n          \"field\": \"study_summary_A.paper_kind\",\n          \"value\": \"empirical\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"content_clues\": [\n        {\n          \"field\": \"study_summary_A.work_summary\",\n          \"value\": \"本研究旨在探讨肠道微生物组在HIV感染及抗逆转录病毒治疗（ART）过程中的作用，特别是区分微生物失调是疾病的原因还是结果。通过全基因组测序和生物信息学分析，比较了HIV阴性人群与接受ART治疗的HIV感染者在治疗前、后6个月及12个月的肠道微生物组成和代谢通路。研究发现，HIV感染者存在显著的微生物失调，表现为促炎微生物富集和特定菌门比例改变。ART治疗虽能部分改善这种失调，但无法完全恢复，且持续影响某些关键代谢通路（如丙酮酸发酵至异丁醇途径），这与Ruminococcus bromii物种的减少相关。\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"Ch7\"\n      ],\n      \"unit_links\": [\n        {\n          \"chapter_id\": \"Ch7\",\n          \"unit_id\": \"Ch7_U02\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"review_source_handles\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0059\",\n      \"identity\": {\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0059\",\n        \"source_id\": \"source::P0059\",\n        \"aliases\": [],\n        \"title\": \"Gut microbiota, blood metabolites, & pan-cancer: a bidirectional Mendelian randomization & mediation analysis\",\n        \"doi\": \"10.1186/s13568-025-01866-w\",\n        \"paper_id\": \"17ba876d38a8e17cb28818078cc688a8c081f3d6\",\n        \"year\": \"2025\",\n        \"canonical_paper_id\": null\n      },\n      \"source_types\": [\n        {\n          \"field\": \"study_summary_A.paper_kind\",\n          \"value\": \"empirical\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"content_clues\": [\n        {\n          \"field\": \"study_summary_A.work_summary\",\n          \"value\": \"本研究旨在解决肠道微生物群改变是癌症病因还是继发后果的争议，以及两者间的双向因果和代谢介导机制尚不明确的问题。作者利用两样本双向孟德尔随机化（MR）分析，结合多变量MR（MVMR）和中介效应分析，系统评估了肠道微生物、血浆代谢物与泛癌风险之间的潜在因果联系。研究通过筛选遗传工具变量，排除了异质性和水平多效性干扰，识别出具有稳健因果关联的微生物、代谢物和通路，并量化了代谢物在微生物-癌症轴中的中介比例。\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"Ch7\"\n      ],\n      \"unit_links\": [\n        {\n          \"chapter_id\": \"Ch7\",\n          \"unit_id\": \"Ch7_U02\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"review_source_handles\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0005\",\n      \"identity\": {\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0005\",\n        \"source_id\": \"source::P0005\",\n        \"aliases\": [],\n        \"title\": \"Microbiomes and immune checkpoint mechanisms in cancer progression: A structured narrative review\",\n        \"doi\": \"10.4314/ajcem.v26i4.1\",\n        \"paper_id\": \"00e9c72b93d5034e0c627ebdbe4d727190a7dd8d\",\n        \"year\": \"2025\",\n        \"canonical_paper_id\": null\n      },\n      \"source_types\": [\n        {\n          \"field\": \"study_summary_A.paper_kind\",\n          \"value\": \"review\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"content_clues\": [\n        {\n          \"field\": \"study_summary_A.work_summary\",\n          \"value\": \"This structured narrative review synthesizes current knowledge on how the microbiome modulates immune responses and affects the efficacy of immune checkpoint inhibitors (ICIs) in cancer. The authors outline the biological basis of immune checkpoints, discuss specific microbial species and metabolites that influence T-cell activity, and explore challenges such as inter-individual variability and dysbiosis. The paper highlights the potential of combining microbiome modulation (via probiotics, diet, or FMT) with ICI therapies to overcome resistance and improve patient outcomes, while noting gaps in understanding molecular signaling pathways and the role of non-gut microbiomes.\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"Ch7\"\n      ],\n      \"unit_links\": [\n        {\n          \"chapter_id\": \"Ch7\",\n          \"unit_id\": \"Ch7_U02\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"review_source_handles\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0010\",\n      \"identity\": {\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0010\",\n        \"source_id\": \"source::P0010\",\n        \"aliases\": [],\n        \"title\": \"Analyzing the gut microbiome in adolescent and young adult patients with melanoma receiving immune checkpoint blockade.\",\n        \"doi\": \"10.1200/jco.2024.42.16_suppl.9563\",\n        \"paper_id\": \"035c34646887b9612a3901c1b65bb5659e6881bb\",\n        \"year\": \"2024\",\n        \"canonical_paper_id\": null\n      },\n      \"source_types\": [\n        {\n          \"field\": \"study_summary_A.paper_kind\",\n          \"value\": \"empirical\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"content_clues\": [\n        {\n          \"field\": \"study_summary_A.work_summary\",\n          \"value\": \"本研究旨在比较AYA与老年黑色素瘤患者在接受免疫检查点抑制剂治疗前的肠道微生物组特征差异。研究从既往大型研究中提取了23名AYA患者，并按2:1比例匹配了46名老年患者作为对照。在控制了性别、BMI、种族、疾病分期等混杂因素后，通过测序数据分析两组间的微生物多样性及特定菌属丰度。研究发现两组间整体多样性无显著差异，但物种组成存在显著不同：老年组中富集了随年龄增长而增加的Ruminococcaceae科及与肥胖相关的Blautia和Dorea属细菌，而AYA组中Bacteroides stercoris丰度较高。结论指出AYA与老年患者的肠道菌群特征存在本质差异，提示针对AYA人群的微生物调节策略需区别于老年人。\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"Ch7\"\n      ],\n      \"unit_links\": [\n        {\n          \"chapter_id\": \"Ch7\",\n          \"unit_id\": \"Ch7_U02\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"review_source_handles\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0439\",\n      \"identity\": {\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0439\",\n        \"source_id\": \"source::P0439\",\n        \"aliases\": [],\n        \"title\": \"Harnessing the gut microbiome for improved immune checkpoint inhibition in colorectal cancer immunotherapy: a narrative Review.\",\n        \"doi\": \"10.1007/s10238-026-02222-3\",\n        \"paper_id\": \"c0d5128fb69f9f60402c1c706b6276fd527e51fd\",\n        \"year\": \"2026\",\n        \"canonical_paper_id\": null\n      },\n      \"source_types\": [\n        {\n          \"field\": \"study_summary_A.paper_kind\",\n          \"value\": \"review\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"content_clues\": [\n        {\n          \"field\": \"study_summary_A.work_summary\",\n          \"value\": \"这是一篇叙事性综述，旨在总结肠道微生物组在结直肠癌发生、发展及免疫治疗反应中的作用机制，并评估益生菌、粪菌移植（FMT）、饮食调节和传统药物等微生物组干预措施作为ICIs辅助治疗的潜力与安全性。文章指出，尽管微生物组调控在临床前模型中显示出增强抗肿瘤免疫的潜力，但现有证据存在不一致性且缺乏大规模临床试验支持，因此强调需要标准化的方法和更严谨的临床验证。\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"Ch7\"\n      ],\n      \"unit_links\": [\n        {\n          \"chapter_id\": \"Ch7\",\n          \"unit_id\": \"Ch7_U03\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"review_source_handles\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0045\",\n      \"identity\": {\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0045\",\n        \"source_id\": \"source::P0045\",\n        \"aliases\": [],\n        \"title\": \"A pan-tumor prospective translational, Irish study, investigating the association of gut microbiome (GM) diversity with pathological complete response (pCR) after neoadjuvant treatment in early stage breast, rectal, and esophageal cancers.\",\n        \"doi\": \"10.1200/jco.2024.42.16_suppl.tps3188\",\n        \"paper_id\": \"141b72207880ce08b4f4717db8c0235c5054dc90\",\n        \"year\": \"2024\",\n        \"canonical_paper_id\": null\n      },\n      \"source_types\": [\n        {\n          \"field\": \"study_summary_A.paper_kind\",\n          \"value\": \"empirical\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"content_clues\": [\n        {\n          \"field\": \"study_summary_A.work_summary\",\n          \"value\": \"该论文介绍了一项正在进行的爱尔兰多中心转化研究，旨在探讨基线肠道微生物组（GM）多样性与新辅助治疗后病理完全缓解（pCR）之间的关联。研究假设基线GM多样性更高将导致更好的病理反应。目前招募仍在进行中，已纳入14名患者，预计2025年初得出结果。摘要主要描述了研究设计、可行性验证及初步招募情况，未提供最终的统计分析结果或发现。\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"Ch7\"\n      ],\n      \"unit_links\": [\n        {\n          \"chapter_id\": \"Ch7\",\n          \"unit_id\": \"Ch7_U03\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"review_source_handles\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0008\",\n      \"identity\": {\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0008\",\n        \"source_id\": \"source::P0008\",\n        \"aliases\": [],\n        \"title\": \"The Influence of the Gut Microbiome in Paediatric Cancer Origin and Treatment\",\n        \"doi\": \"10.3390/antibiotics11111521\",\n        \"paper_id\": \"01c9e6afed12fde12a7b31338861ed47eeb567fa\",\n        \"year\": \"2022\",\n        \"canonical_paper_id\": null\n      },\n      \"source_types\": [\n        {\n          \"field\": \"study_summary_A.paper_kind\",\n          \"value\": \"review\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"content_clues\": [\n        {\n          \"field\": \"study_summary_A.work_summary\",\n          \"value\": \"这是一篇2022年的综述文章，旨在总结肠道微生物组在儿科肿瘤发生和治疗中的最新研究进展。文章首先概述了微生物组的一般生理作用及其通过免疫调节影响癌症的机制，随后重点讨论了儿科特异性，包括分娩方式、喂养方式对微生物组的影响，以及化疗和放疗引起的微生物组变化。研究发现，微生物组的变化与治疗反应和毒性相关，但目前证据多来自成人或小型儿科队列，且因果关系尚不明确。\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"Ch7\"\n      ],\n      \"unit_links\": [\n        {\n          \"chapter_id\": \"Ch7\",\n          \"unit_id\": \"Ch7_U03\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"review_source_handles\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0030\",\n      \"identity\": {\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0030\",\n        \"source_id\": \"source::P0030\",\n        \"aliases\": [],\n        \"title\": \"Efficacy and safety of adjuvant short-course immune checkpoint inhibitors following TACE combined with MWA in patients with BCLC A–B hepatocellular carcinoma: a single-arm, prospective, phase II study protocol\",\n        \"doi\": \"10.1136/bmjopen-2025-111786\",\n        \"paper_id\": \"0e52b2409fa157d1812995e5c089e1e03b4bad34\",\n        \"year\": \"2025\",\n        \"canonical_paper_id\": null\n      },\n      \"source_types\": [\n        {\n          \"field\": \"study_summary_A.paper_kind\",\n          \"value\": \"methods\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"content_clues\": [\n        {\n          \"field\": \"study_summary_A.work_summary\",\n          \"value\": \"本文是一篇单臂、前瞻性、II期临床试验方案，旨在评估在TACE联合MWA治疗BCLC A–B期HCC并确认完全缓解后，使用6个月短程辅助特瑞普利单抗（200 mg，每3周一次）的疗效和安全性。研究主要终点为无复发生存期（RFS），次要终点包括局部肿瘤进展、肝内远处复发、肝外疾病时间、总生存期及不良事件。该研究基于TACE诱导免疫原性细胞死亡与MWA协同作用产生有利免疫微环境的理论假设，试图验证短程辅助免疫治疗的可行性。由于这是一份试验方案（Protocol），目前尚未报告实际的患者入组数据或最终结果。\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"Ch7\"\n      ],\n      \"unit_links\": [\n        {\n          \"chapter_id\": \"Ch7\",\n          \"unit_id\": \"Ch7_U03\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"review_source_handles\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0484\",\n      \"identity\": {\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0484\",\n        \"source_id\": \"source::P0484\",\n        \"aliases\": [],\n        \"title\": \"The aging microbiome and response to immunotherapy: considerations for the treatment of older adults with cancer\",\n        \"doi\": \"10.1016/j.jgo.2021.02.001\",\n        \"paper_id\": \"d9c8811c9fe1a30956b5b250c0de876c0e270551\",\n        \"year\": \"2021\",\n        \"canonical_paper_id\": null\n      },\n      \"source_types\": [\n        {\n          \"field\": \"study_summary_A.paper_kind\",\n          \"value\": \"review\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"content_clues\": [\n        {\n          \"field\": \"study_summary_A.work_summary\",\n          \"value\": \"本文是一篇综述，旨在探讨肠道微生物组随年龄变化的特征及其对老年癌症患者接受免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs）治疗反应的影响。文章总结了与衰老相关的微生物变化文献，并将其置于ICIs疗效的背景下进行解读，提出了一种解释这些广泛变化的模型，并讨论了针对这一未被充分研究人群的临床试验现状。\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"Ch7\"\n      ],\n      \"unit_links\": [\n        {\n          \"chapter_id\": \"Ch7\",\n          \"unit_id\": \"Ch7_U03\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"review_source_handles\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0524\",\n      \"identity\": {\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0524\",\n        \"source_id\": \"source::P0524\",\n        \"aliases\": [],\n        \"title\": \"Challenges and knowledge gaps with immune checkpoint inhibitors monotherapy in the management of patients with non-small-cell lung cancer: a survey of oncologist perceptions\",\n        \"doi\": \"10.1016/j.esmoop.2022.100764\",\n        \"paper_id\": \"eb8389aa4db9c7fa1d42d82f39f1ba4436f3b701\",\n        \"year\": \"2023\",\n        \"canonical_paper_id\": null\n      },\n      \"source_types\": [\n        {\n          \"field\": \"study_summary_A.paper_kind\",\n          \"value\": \"empirical\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"content_clues\": [\n        {\n          \"field\": \"study_summary_A.work_summary\",\n          \"value\": \"本研究旨在评估肿瘤科医生在NSCLC临床实践中使用ICI单药治疗时面临的主要挑战和知识空白。通过Oncodistinct跨国研究网络发起了一项在线问卷调查，涵盖18个具体主题和一个开放性问题。问卷经过两轮专家试点测试验证。数据收集于2019年9月至2020年2月，采用雪球法传播。最终分析纳入106名完全填写问卷且自报治疗过至少20名NSCLC患者的医生的回答。结果以描述性统计呈现，识别了临床决策中的不确定性领域和优先研究方向。\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"Ch7\"\n      ],\n      \"unit_links\": [\n        {\n          \"chapter_id\": \"Ch7\",\n          \"unit_id\": \"Ch7_U03\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"review_source_handles\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0323\",\n      \"identity\": {\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0323\",\n        \"source_id\": \"source::P0323\",\n        \"aliases\": [],\n        \"title\": \"The dark matter in cancer immunology: beyond the visible– unveiling multiomics pathways to breakthrough therapies\",\n        \"doi\": \"10.1186/s12967-025-06839-y\",\n        \"paper_id\": \"8a42b4f37f1c7313faa25f37bb036aac0202e1c7\",\n        \"year\": \"2025\",\n        \"canonical_paper_id\": null\n      },\n      \"source_types\": [\n        {\n          \"field\": \"study_summary_A.paper_kind\",\n          \"value\": \"review\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"content_clues\": [\n        {\n          \"field\": \"study_summary_A.work_summary\",\n          \"value\": \"这是一篇综述文章，旨在重新定义并扩展“癌症暗物质”的概念，从仅指代癌细胞内在的非编码RNA和蛋白质，扩展到包括影响肿瘤微环境中细胞网络的更广泛元素。文章系统梳理了多组学技术（基因组、转录组、蛋白质组、代谢组、微生物组等）如何揭示这些隐藏的生物机制，特别是通过“病毒模拟”现象增强癌症细胞的免疫原性。它探讨了这些发现对理解免疫介导的癌症排斥、免疫逃逸及治疗耐药性的意义，并提出了利用这些新靶点开发个性化免疫疗法（如基于ncORF的疫苗和CAR-T细胞疗法）的策略。\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"Ch7\"\n      ],\n      \"unit_links\": [\n        {\n          \"chapter_id\": \"Ch7\",\n          \"unit_id\": \"Ch7_U04\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"review_source_handles\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0416\",\n      \"identity\": {\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0416\",\n        \"source_id\": \"source::P0416\",\n        \"aliases\": [],\n        \"title\": \"Immune-reactive tumor organoids system to determine the effects of microbial metabolites on cancer immunity and immunotherapies\",\n        \"doi\": \"10.3389/frmbi.2024.1411322\",\n        \"paper_id\": \"b68d0c2836362527000931b8f1fefbb2a4f2dd3b\",\n        \"year\": \"2024\",\n        \"canonical_paper_id\": null\n      },\n      \"source_types\": [\n        {\n          \"field\": \"study_summary_A.paper_kind\",\n          \"value\": \"review\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"content_clues\": [\n        {\n          \"field\": \"study_summary_A.work_summary\",\n          \"value\": \"This paper is a narrative review that argues for the utility of immune-reactive tumor organoids in deciphering how the microbiome influences cancer immunity and response to immunotherapies. It begins by outlining the clinical evidence linking gut microbiota composition to ICI outcomes in solid tumors, summarizing key findings from multiple clinical trials regarding specific bacterial taxa and metabolites. The review then critiques existing modeling systems (2D cultures and animal models), highlighting their limitations in capturing human-specific immune-microbiome-tumor dynamics. It proposes immune-reactive organoids—created either by retaining endogenous immune cells or co-culturing autologous immune cells with tumor organoids—as a superior ex vivo platform. The authors discuss recent experimental data using these organoid systems to test microbial metabolites and checkpoint blockade efficacy, assessing their validity for personalized medicine and mechanistic insight.\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"Ch7\"\n      ],\n      \"unit_links\": [\n        {\n          \"chapter_id\": \"Ch7\",\n          \"unit_id\": \"Ch7_U04\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"review_source_handles\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0050\",\n      \"identity\": {\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0050\",\n        \"source_id\": \"source::P0050\",\n        \"aliases\": [],\n        \"title\": \"Artificial intelligence–enabled multi-omics biomarkers for immune checkpoint blockade: mechanisms, predictive modeling, and clinical translation\",\n        \"doi\": \"10.3389/fimmu.2026.1732079\",\n        \"paper_id\": \"164f89ae032b4a17e939d4531f3f7f8ddb4c81ee\",\n        \"year\": \"2026\",\n        \"canonical_paper_id\": null\n      },\n      \"source_types\": [\n        {\n          \"field\": \"study_summary_A.paper_kind\",\n          \"value\": \"review\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"content_clues\": [\n        {\n          \"field\": \"study_summary_A.work_summary\",\n          \"value\": \"本文是一篇综述，旨在总结AI驱动的多组学生物标志物在免疫检查点阻断治疗中的作用。文章首先梳理了ICI疗效与耐药性的生物学基础，包括谱系可塑性、抗原呈递缺陷、代谢-表观遗传抑制、微生物群调节及干细胞特性等机制。随后，阐述了如何利用机器学习（如LASSO、随机森林、深度学习CNN）和深度学习方法整合异构多组学数据，构建复合预测模型，并强调可解释性工具（如SHAP、Grad-CAM）在连接模型输出与生物学机制中的重要性。最后，讨论了这些工具在患者分层、联合疗法选择、新辅助治疗指导及纵向监测中的临床应用，并指出了数据异质性、前瞻性验证不足、隐私限制、模型漂移及公平性等转化障碍，提出了单细胞/空间多组学整合、联邦学习及生成式建模等未来方向。\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"Ch7\"\n      ],\n      \"unit_links\": [\n        {\n          \"chapter_id\": \"Ch7\",\n          \"unit_id\": \"Ch7_U04\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"review_source_handles\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0054\",\n      \"identity\": {\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0054\",\n        \"source_id\": \"source::P0054\",\n        \"aliases\": [],\n        \"title\": \"Artificial Intelligence–Enabled Multi-Omics for Predicting Immune Checkpoint Inhibitor Response and Resistance\",\n        \"doi\": \"10.2147/jmdh.s572089\",\n        \"paper_id\": \"174066de2e0865cbf905ef36de34933107992fa8\",\n        \"year\": \"2026\",\n        \"canonical_paper_id\": null\n      },\n      \"source_types\": [\n        {\n          \"field\": \"study_summary_A.paper_kind\",\n          \"value\": \"review\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"content_clues\": [\n        {\n          \"field\": \"study_summary_A.work_summary\",\n          \"value\": \"本文是一篇叙事性综述，系统梳理了人工智能与多组学技术在预测免疫检查点抑制剂响应和耐药方面的最新进展。文章首先阐述了ICI疗效差异的生物学基础，包括肿瘤异质性、干细胞特性、微环境重塑及微生物组调控；随后介绍了AI算法如何整合异构多组学数据以发现生物标志物、构建预测模型并进行患者分层；接着讨论了这些模型在指导联合治疗、实时监测和毒性预测中的临床转化潜力；最后分析了实施障碍（如数据异质性、黑盒性质、缺乏前瞻性验证）并展望了单细胞/空间多组学、联邦学习和生成式AI等未来方向。\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"Ch7\"\n      ],\n      \"unit_links\": [\n        {\n          \"chapter_id\": \"Ch7\",\n          \"unit_id\": \"Ch7_U04\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"review_source_handles\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0574\",\n      \"identity\": {\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0574\",\n        \"source_id\": \"source::P0574\",\n        \"aliases\": [],\n        \"title\": \"Gut dysbiosis in oncology: a risk factor for immunoresistance\",\n        \"doi\": \"10.1038/s41422-025-01212-6\",\n        \"paper_id\": \"ff5504ec23a09bb1d577854219dadfe3c7772ece\",\n        \"year\": \"2026\",\n        \"canonical_paper_id\": null\n      },\n      \"source_types\": [\n        {\n          \"field\": \"study_summary_A.paper_kind\",\n          \"value\": \"review\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"content_clues\": [\n        {\n          \"field\": \"study_summary_A.work_summary\",\n          \"value\": \"这是一篇综述论文，旨在解决肠道微生物组在临床转化中因“菌群失调”定义不一致、生物标志物框架不足及机制理解有限而面临的障碍。文章综合了现有知识，阐述了肠道微生物组成和功能如何影响ICI疗效，区分了相关性与因果证据。作者讨论了基于α-多样性或分类丰度的计算方法，并主张采用更具功能和临床信息量的模型（如TOPOSCORE）。通过回顾性分析数千名患者和对照组的宏基因组数据，研究了区分响应者和非响应者的微生物模式。此外，探讨了菌群失调如何干扰免疫调节通路（如胆汁酸代谢、肠道通透性和黏膜免疫调节），评估了纠正微生物功能障碍的 emerging 治疗策略（饮食、细菌联合体、FMT），并介绍了ONCOBIOME倡议及其全球Atlas平台。\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"Ch7\"\n      ],\n      \"unit_links\": [\n        {\n          \"chapter_id\": \"Ch7\",\n          \"unit_id\": \"Ch7_U04\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"review_source_handles\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0172\",\n      \"identity\": {\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0172\",\n        \"source_id\": \"source::P0172\",\n        \"aliases\": [],\n        \"title\": \"From mechanisms to precision medicine: the role of organoids in studying the gut microbiota-tumor microenvironment axis\",\n        \"doi\": \"10.3389/fmicb.2025.1669482\",\n        \"paper_id\": \"4a8bc3da652bbd783e7ea5c1dbde908e5124c442\",\n        \"year\": \"2025\",\n        \"canonical_paper_id\": null\n      },\n      \"source_types\": [\n        {\n          \"field\": \"study_summary_A.paper_kind\",\n          \"value\": \"review\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"content_clues\": [\n        {\n          \"field\": \"study_summary_A.work_summary\",\n          \"value\": \"This review article synthesizes current research on how intestinal organoids serve as a bridge for understanding host-microbiota crosstalk within the tumor microenvironment. It details the technical advantages of organoids over traditional 2D cultures and animal models, classifies different types of organoid models, and discusses their applications in deciphering carcinogenic mechanisms driven by microbial dysbiosis, validating tumor-specific microbial features, and exploring bidirectional regulatory mechanisms of microbial metabolites. The paper also addresses the integration of multi-omics technologies and organ-on-a-chip systems to enhance physiological relevance, while critically evaluating limitations such as the lack of complete immune/stromal components and challenges in clinical translation.\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"Ch7\"\n      ],\n      \"unit_links\": [\n        {\n          \"chapter_id\": \"Ch7\",\n          \"unit_id\": \"Ch7_U04\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"review_source_handles\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0532\",\n      \"identity\": {\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0532\",\n        \"source_id\": \"source::P0532\",\n        \"aliases\": [],\n        \"title\": \"Focus on gut microbes: new direction in cancer treatment\",\n        \"doi\": \"10.3389/fonc.2025.1505656\",\n        \"paper_id\": \"ed9f49b6f8cea1ce51cbf797f10d7a01e6835e15\",\n        \"year\": \"2025\",\n        \"canonical_paper_id\": null\n      },\n      \"source_types\": [\n        {\n          \"field\": \"study_summary_A.paper_kind\",\n          \"value\": \"review\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"content_clues\": [\n        {\n          \"field\": \"study_summary_A.work_summary\",\n          \"value\": \"本文是一篇关于肠道微生物在癌症治疗中作用的全面综述。文章首先概述了肠道微生物作为人体最大免疫器官的功能及其与宿主健康的相互作用，随后详细阐述了肠道微生物如何影响六大类抗肿瘤治疗（放化疗、靶向、免疫、中药、康复）的疗效与毒性。接着，文章深入探讨了微生物通过代谢产物、免疫微环境调节、生物物理特性改变、胞内细菌定植及DNA稳定性维持等五大机制干预肿瘤治疗的生物学基础。最后，讨论了基于微生物群的临床转化策略（如FMT、益生菌、工程菌）面临的个体差异、安全性及标准化挑战，并展望了多组学与人工智能结合的未来方向。\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"Ch7\"\n      ],\n      \"unit_links\": [\n        {\n          \"chapter_id\": \"Ch7\",\n          \"unit_id\": \"Ch7_U04\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"review_source_handles\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0555\",\n      \"identity\": {\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0555\",\n        \"source_id\": \"source::P0555\",\n        \"aliases\": [],\n        \"title\": \"Unveiling the interplay between microbiota and PD1/PD-L1 axis in tumor immunity and immunotherapy\",\n        \"doi\": \"10.3389/fimmu.2025.1690374\",\n        \"paper_id\": \"f661d588e0fee18c37ed1d46fd697c2ad01c4394\",\n        \"year\": \"2025\",\n        \"canonical_paper_id\": null\n      },\n      \"source_types\": [\n        {\n          \"field\": \"study_summary_A.paper_kind\",\n          \"value\": \"review\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"content_clues\": [\n        {\n          \"field\": \"study_summary_A.work_summary\",\n          \"value\": \"本文是一篇2025年发表的综述，旨在系统梳理微生物群如何影响PD-1/PD-L1介导的肿瘤免疫逃逸及免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs）的治疗疗效。文章首先阐述了微生物群通过直接相互作用和产生代谢物（如短链脂肪酸SCFAs）调节宿主免疫系统的基础作用；随后深入探讨了微生物群调控PD-1/PD-L1表达的具体分子机制，包括表观遗传修饰、受体配体相互作用及信号通路激活；接着总结了特定微生物菌种及其代谢物作为预测生物标志物和克服ICIs耐药性的策略；最后讨论了非肠道微生物群的作用以及从临床前模型向临床应用转化的挑战与前景。\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"Ch7\"\n      ],\n      \"unit_links\": [\n        {\n          \"chapter_id\": \"Ch7\",\n          \"unit_id\": \"Ch7_U04\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"review_source_handles\": []\n    }\n  ],\n  \"tool_catalog\": [\n    {\n      \"tool_handle\": \"tool_001\",\n      \"title\": null,\n      \"question\": \"跨队列黑色素瘤研究，需详细提取其关于‘无通用标志物’的具体统计依据及队列间异质性来源分析。\",\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"Ch7\"\n      ],\n      \"source_identity_statuses\": [\n        null\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"tool_handle\": \"tool_002\",\n      \"title\": null,\n      \"question\": \"是否有已完成的大型随机对照 III 期临床试验证实微生物干预（如 FMT）在 ICI 治疗实体瘤中的疗效？\",\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"Ch5\",\n        \"Ch6\"\n      ],\n      \"source_identity_statuses\": [\n        null,\n        \"conflicting_handle\",\n        \"conflicting_identity\",\n        \"unresolved_identity\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"tool_handle\": \"tool_003\",\n      \"title\": null,\n      \"question\": \"抗生素暴露时机（治疗前 vs. 治疗后）对 ICI 疗效影响的系统 meta 分析证据是什么？\",\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"Ch4\"\n      ],\n      \"source_identity_statuses\": [\n        null,\n        \"conflicting_handle\",\n        \"conflicting_identity\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"tool_handle\": \"tool_004\",\n      \"title\": null,\n      \"question\": \"是否有已完成的大型随机对照 III 期临床试验证实微生物干预（如 FMT）在 ICI 治疗实体瘤中的疗效？\",\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"Ch5\"\n      ],\n      \"source_identity_statuses\": [\n        null,\n        \"conflicting_handle\",\n        \"unresolved_identity\",\n        \"conflicting_identity\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"tool_handle\": \"tool_005\",\n      \"title\": null,\n      \"question\": \"FMT-LUMINate 试验中 FMT 联合 ICI 的 ORR 数据是多少？供体菌群特征（如 Prevotella）与毒性（心肌炎）的关联机制是什么？\",\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"Ch5\"\n      ],\n      \"source_identity_statuses\": [\n        null,\n        \"unresolved_identity\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"tool_handle\": \"tool_006\",\n      \"title\": null,\n      \"question\": \"是否有针对非结肠炎 irAEs（如心肌炎、神经毒性）的大规模微生物组关联研究，以验证 P0051 和 P0530 中提到的样本量小或证据不足的问题？\",\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"Ch6\"\n      ],\n      \"source_identity_statuses\": [\n        null,\n        \"conflicting_identity\",\n        \"remapped\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"tool_handle\": \"tool_007\",\n      \"title\": null,\n      \"question\": \"是否有已完成的大型随机对照 III 期临床试验证实微生物干预（如 FMT）在 ICI 治疗实体瘤中的疗效？\",\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"Ch5\"\n      ],\n      \"source_identity_statuses\": [\n        null,\n        \"conflicting_handle\",\n        \"conflicting_identity\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"tool_handle\": \"tool_008\",\n      \"title\": null,\n      \"question\": \"是否有针对非结肠炎 irAEs（如心肌炎、神经毒性）的大规模微生物组关联研究，以验证 P0051 和 P0530 中提到的样本量小或证据不足的问题？\",\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"Ch6\"\n      ],\n      \"source_identity_statuses\": [\n        null,\n        \"conflicting_identity\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"tool_handle\": \"tool_009\",\n      \"title\": null,\n      \"question\": \"是否有已完成的大型随机对照 III 期临床试验证实微生物干预（如 FMT）在 ICI 治疗实体瘤中的疗效？\",\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"Ch1\",\n        \"Ch5\"\n      ],\n      \"source_identity_statuses\": [\n        null,\n        \"conflicting_handle\",\n        \"conflicting_identity\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"tool_handle\": \"tool_010\",\n      \"title\": null,\n      \"question\": \"JCOG2007 III 期试验中肠道微生物组与 NSCLC 患者 ICI 疗效及毒性的具体关联数据是什么？\",\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"Ch1\",\n        \"Ch5\"\n      ],\n      \"source_identity_statuses\": [\n        null,\n        \"conflicting_identity\",\n        \"conflicting_handle\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"tool_handle\": \"tool_011\",\n      \"title\": null,\n      \"question\": \"人体肿瘤微环境内肌苷（inosine）的生理浓度及其与 ICI 疗效的具体相关性数据是什么？\",\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"Ch3\"\n      ],\n      \"source_identity_statuses\": [\n        null,\n        \"conflicting_handle\",\n        \"unresolved_identity\",\n        \"conflicting_identity\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"tool_handle\": \"tool_012\",\n      \"title\": null,\n      \"question\": \"MITRIC 试验中 FMT 在 ICI 耐药患者中的 ORR 及 PFS 数据是多少？为何结果为阴性？\",\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"Ch5\"\n      ],\n      \"source_identity_statuses\": [\n        \"conflicting_identity\",\n        null\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"tool_handle\": \"tool_013\",\n      \"title\": null,\n      \"question\": \"Prevotella spp. 诱导心肌炎的具体分子机制（如通过何种抗原或代谢物激活特定 T 细胞亚群）在 FMT-LUMINate 研究中仅表现为相关性，是否有后续研究解析其下游信号通路？\",\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"Ch6\"\n      ],\n      \"source_identity_statuses\": [\n        null,\n        \"unresolved_identity\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"tool_handle\": \"tool_014\",\n      \"title\": null,\n      \"question\": \"JCOG2007 III 期试验中肠道微生物组与 NSCLC 患者 ICI 疗效及毒性的具体关联数据是什么？\",\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"Ch4\"\n      ],\n      \"source_identity_statuses\": [\n        null,\n        \"conflicting_handle\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"tool_handle\": \"tool_015\",\n      \"title\": null,\n      \"question\": \"人体肿瘤微环境内肌苷（inosine）的生理浓度及其与 ICI 疗效的具体相关性数据是什么？\",\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"Ch3\"\n      ],\n      \"source_identity_statuses\": [\n        null,\n        \"conflicting_handle\",\n        \"conflicting_identity\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"materials\": [\n    {\n      \"packet_kind\": \"source\",\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0098\",\n      \"source_identity\": {\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0098\",\n        \"source_id\": \"source::P0098\",\n        \"aliases\": [],\n        \"title\": \"Abstract 3463: Longitudinal microbiome-immune dynamics in melanoma patients treated with immune checkpoint inhibitor immunotherapy\",\n        \"doi\": \"10.1158/1538-7445.am2023-3463\",\n        \"paper_id\": \"2709ffca937655fdff12c871b14cb93ee1830d79\",\n        \"year\": \"2023\",\n        \"canonical_paper_id\": null\n      },\n      \"evidence_atoms\": [\n        {\n          \"atom_id\": \"atom::b67c869eee5a32d72d756c1f\",\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0098\",\n          \"field_path\": [\n            \"material_depth\"\n          ],\n          \"value\": \"abstract\",\n          \"role\": \"evidence\",\n          \"origins\": [\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::abeae3f5437f046402745e3d90c12137942e031e6a48cef52cb857f87928ce97\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"material_depth\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::6bd724179a28fdc49a9796137c61dc5af3dc79da06a51d29961b4c4029176986\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"material_depth\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::da0f21f85aefb292e922131e9a325a641129db8a0e28454cc10d9988dc744a7b\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"material_depth\"\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"atom_id\": \"atom::905a16b1317dae09553557fb\",\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0098\",\n          \"field_path\": [\n            \"material_status\"\n          ],\n          \"value\": \"resolved\",\n          \"role\": \"evidence\",\n          \"origins\": [\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::abeae3f5437f046402745e3d90c12137942e031e6a48cef52cb857f87928ce97\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"material_status\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::6bd724179a28fdc49a9796137c61dc5af3dc79da06a51d29961b4c4029176986\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"material_status\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::da0f21f85aefb292e922131e9a325a641129db8a0e28454cc10d9988dc744a7b\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"material_status\"\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"atom_id\": \"atom::4fc1b23aa9738aec8d869909\",\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0098\",\n          \"field_path\": [\n            \"study_summary_A\",\n            \"approach\"\n          ],\n          \"value\": \"纵向队列研究设计。收集III期黑色素瘤患者在联合ICI治疗前（基线）和治疗后第6周的配对粪便样本（n=126）和外周血PBMC样本（n=71）。使用16S rRNA基因测序分析肠道微生物组成，使用质谱流式细胞术全面 profiling 循环免疫细胞亚群。比较基线与第6周的微生物和免疫指标变化，并分析其与临床应答状态及irAEs严重程度的关联。\",\n          \"role\": \"evidence\",\n          \"origins\": [\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::abeae3f5437f046402745e3d90c12137942e031e6a48cef52cb857f87928ce97\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"study_summary_A\",\n                \"approach\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::6bd724179a28fdc49a9796137c61dc5af3dc79da06a51d29961b4c4029176986\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"study_summary_A\",\n                \"approach\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::da0f21f85aefb292e922131e9a325a641129db8a0e28454cc10d9988dc744a7b\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"study_summary_A\",\n                \"approach\"\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"atom_id\": \"atom::ddc7133862b1e98dee7bbcc4\",\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0098\",\n          \"field_path\": [\n            \"study_summary_A\",\n            \"contribution_and_limits\"\n          ],\n          \"value\": {\n            \"contribution\": \"提供了纵向证据，表明肠道微生物组（特别是拟杆菌属和瘤胃球菌科）与ICI治疗期间的免疫细胞动态（特别是Tregs）及临床结局（应答和irAEs）存在关联。\",\n            \"limits\": \"所给摘要未交代具体的统计校正方法（如多重检验校正）、微生物功能推断细节、以及是否控制了其他混杂因素（如抗生素使用、饮食等）。此外，作为会议摘要，缺乏完整的实验细节和长期随访数据。\"\n          },\n          \"role\": \"evidence\",\n          \"origins\": [\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::abeae3f5437f046402745e3d90c12137942e031e6a48cef52cb857f87928ce97\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"study_summary_A\",\n                \"contribution_and_limits\",\n                \"0\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::6bd724179a28fdc49a9796137c61dc5af3dc79da06a51d29961b4c4029176986\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"study_summary_A\",\n                \"contribution_and_limits\",\n                \"0\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::da0f21f85aefb292e922131e9a325a641129db8a0e28454cc10d9988dc744a7b\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"study_summary_A\",\n                \"contribution_and_limits\",\n                \"0\"\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"atom_id\": \"atom::5ced063ef4d895bb2527ef3c\",\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0098\",\n          \"field_path\": [\n            \"study_summary_A\",\n            \"key_findings\"\n          ],\n          \"value\": {\n            \"conditions\": \"ICI治疗前后对比\",\n            \"finding\": \"治疗导致循环中CD8+效应记忆T细胞（Tem）频率增加（P=0.0096）和调节性T细胞（Tregs）频率减少（P=0.0029）。\"\n          },\n          \"role\": \"evidence\",\n          \"origins\": [\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::abeae3f5437f046402745e3d90c12137942e031e6a48cef52cb857f87928ce97\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"study_summary_A\",\n                \"key_findings\",\n                \"0\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::6bd724179a28fdc49a9796137c61dc5af3dc79da06a51d29961b4c4029176986\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"study_summary_A\",\n                \"key_findings\",\n                \"0\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::da0f21f85aefb292e922131e9a325a641129db8a0e28454cc10d9988dc744a7b\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"study_summary_A\",\n                \"key_findings\",\n                \"0\"\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"atom_id\": \"atom::df0c22db80cc042e49db6078\",\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0098\",\n          \"field_path\": [\n            \"study_summary_A\",\n            \"key_findings\"\n          ],\n          \"value\": {\n            \"conditions\": \"根据临床应答分类\",\n            \"finding\": \"Tregs的减少主要在应答者中观察到（P=0.0016），而在非应答者中无显著变化（P=0.9515）。\"\n          },\n          \"role\": \"evidence\",\n          \"origins\": [\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::abeae3f5437f046402745e3d90c12137942e031e6a48cef52cb857f87928ce97\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"study_summary_A\",\n                \"key_findings\",\n                \"1\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::6bd724179a28fdc49a9796137c61dc5af3dc79da06a51d29961b4c4029176986\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"study_summary_A\",\n                \"key_findings\",\n                \"1\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::da0f21f85aefb292e922131e9a325a641129db8a0e28454cc10d9988dc744a7b\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"study_summary_A\",\n                \"key_findings\",\n                \"1\"\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"atom_id\": \"atom::155a4a53fa9c96215b2c32fe\",\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0098\",\n          \"field_path\": [\n            \"study_summary_A\",\n            \"key_findings\"\n          ],\n          \"value\": {\n            \"conditions\": \"根据irAEs严重程度分类\",\n            \"finding\": \"发生严重irAEs的患者在第6周时Tregs显著缺乏（P=0.0293），相比无或轻度毒性患者。\"\n          },\n          \"role\": \"evidence\",\n          \"origins\": [\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::abeae3f5437f046402745e3d90c12137942e031e6a48cef52cb857f87928ce97\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"study_summary_A\",\n                \"key_findings\",\n                \"2\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::6bd724179a28fdc49a9796137c61dc5af3dc79da06a51d29961b4c4029176986\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"study_summary_A\",\n                \"key_findings\",\n                \"2\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::da0f21f85aefb292e922131e9a325a641129db8a0e28454cc10d9988dc744a7b\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"study_summary_A\",\n                \"key_findings\",\n                \"2\"\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"atom_id\": \"atom::4dd917c890edeb09e25c7941\",\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0098\",\n          \"field_path\": [\n            \"study_summary_A\",\n            \"key_findings\"\n          ],\n          \"value\": {\n            \"conditions\": \"基线微生物与免疫变化的关联\",\n            \"finding\": \"在循环Tregs减少的患者中，Tregs减少的程度与基线拟杆菌属（Bacteroides）相对丰度呈正相关（P<0.0001）。\"\n          },\n          \"role\": \"evidence\",\n          \"origins\": [\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::abeae3f5437f046402745e3d90c12137942e031e6a48cef52cb857f87928ce97\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"study_summary_A\",\n                \"key_findings\",\n                \"3\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::6bd724179a28fdc49a9796137c61dc5af3dc79da06a51d29961b4c4029176986\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"study_summary_A\",\n                \"key_findings\",\n                \"3\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::da0f21f85aefb292e922131e9a325a641129db8a0e28454cc10d9988dc744a7b\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"study_summary_A\",\n                \"key_findings\",\n                \"3\"\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"atom_id\": \"atom::43564e4cabb74c63d54ecf12\",\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0098\",\n          \"field_path\": [\n            \"study_summary_A\",\n            \"key_findings\"\n          ],\n          \"value\": {\n            \"conditions\": \"基线微生物与临床结局的关联\",\n            \"finding\": \"较高的基线拟杆菌属丰度与更严重的irAEs发展（P=0.0472）及第6周前更高的类固醇使用率（P=0.0345）相关。相反，较高的瘤胃球菌科（Ruminococcaceae）丰度具有保护作用，且瘤胃球菌科主导的微生物组患者中应答者比例更高。\"\n          },\n          \"role\": \"evidence\",\n          \"origins\": [\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::abeae3f5437f046402745e3d90c12137942e031e6a48cef52cb857f87928ce97\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"study_summary_A\",\n                \"key_findings\",\n                \"4\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::6bd724179a28fdc49a9796137c61dc5af3dc79da06a51d29961b4c4029176986\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"study_summary_A\",\n                \"key_findings\",\n                \"4\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::da0f21f85aefb292e922131e9a325a641129db8a0e28454cc10d9988dc744a7b\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"study_summary_A\",\n                \"key_findings\",\n                \"4\"\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"atom_id\": \"atom::13b30b98ec45be93bfcf01d5\",\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0098\",\n          \"field_path\": [\n            \"study_summary_A\",\n            \"paper_kind\"\n          ],\n          \"value\": \"empirical\",\n          \"role\": \"evidence\",\n          \"origins\": [\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::abeae3f5437f046402745e3d90c12137942e031e6a48cef52cb857f87928ce97\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"study_summary_A\",\n                \"paper_kind\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::6bd724179a28fdc49a9796137c61dc5af3dc79da06a51d29961b4c4029176986\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"study_summary_A\",\n                \"paper_kind\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::da0f21f85aefb292e922131e9a325a641129db8a0e28454cc10d9988dc744a7b\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"study_summary_A\",\n                \"paper_kind\"\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"atom_id\": \"atom::b52da9c89aaeaaa5b0749b6e\",\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0098\",\n          \"field_path\": [\n            \"study_summary_A\",\n            \"problem_or_question\"\n          ],\n          \"value\": \"尽管已知肠道微生物组影响ICI疗效，但具体机制不明。本研究试图解决：肠道微生物如何与免疫系统相互作用以影响ICI的成功或irAEs的发生？特别是特定细菌类群（如拟杆菌属和瘤胃球菌科）与免疫细胞亚群变化及临床结局之间的关联。\",\n          \"role\": \"evidence\",\n          \"origins\": [\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::abeae3f5437f046402745e3d90c12137942e031e6a48cef52cb857f87928ce97\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"study_summary_A\",\n                \"problem_or_question\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::6bd724179a28fdc49a9796137c61dc5af3dc79da06a51d29961b4c4029176986\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"study_summary_A\",\n                \"problem_or_question\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::da0f21f85aefb292e922131e9a325a641129db8a0e28454cc10d9988dc744a7b\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"study_summary_A\",\n                \"problem_or_question\"\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"atom_id\": \"atom::15613d5b09de0b9d50378597\",\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0098\",\n          \"field_path\": [\n            \"study_summary_A\",\n            \"research_scope\"\n          ],\n          \"value\": \"III期黑色素瘤患者，接受新辅助联合抗PD-1/抗CTLA-4免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）治疗；涉及澳大利亚和荷兰队列（n=126），其中71名患者有匹配的PBMC数据。\",\n          \"role\": \"evidence\",\n          \"origins\": [\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::abeae3f5437f046402745e3d90c12137942e031e6a48cef52cb857f87928ce97\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"study_summary_A\",\n                \"research_scope\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::6bd724179a28fdc49a9796137c61dc5af3dc79da06a51d29961b4c4029176986\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"study_summary_A\",\n                \"research_scope\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::da0f21f85aefb292e922131e9a325a641129db8a0e28454cc10d9988dc744a7b\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"study_summary_A\",\n                \"research_scope\"\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"atom_id\": \"atom::35e128a47c0a17f95654887c\",\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0098\",\n          \"field_path\": [\n            \"study_summary_A\",\n            \"work_summary\"\n          ],\n          \"value\": \"该研究旨在阐明肠道微生物组与免疫系统在ICI治疗中的纵向动态关系及其对疗效和免疫相关不良事件（irAEs）的影响。通过对126名患者的基线和第6周粪便样本进行16S rRNA基因测序，并对71名患者的外周血单个核细胞（PBMCs）进行质谱流式细胞术分析，研究发现ICI治疗导致循环中CD8+效应记忆T细胞增加和调节性T细胞（Tregs）减少。Tregs的减少主要见于应答者，但在发生严重irAEs的患者中也观察到显著缺乏。基线拟杆菌属（Bacteroides）丰度与Tregs减少程度及严重irAEs风险正相关，而瘤胃球菌科（Ruminococcaceae）高丰度则具有保护作用并关联更好的应答。结论指出肠道微生物组可能通过影响免疫平衡的“临界点”来塑造ICI的治疗结果。\",\n          \"role\": \"evidence\",\n          \"origins\": [\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::abeae3f5437f046402745e3d90c12137942e031e6a48cef52cb857f87928ce97\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"study_summary_A\",\n                \"work_summary\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::6bd724179a28fdc49a9796137c61dc5af3dc79da06a51d29961b4c4029176986\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"study_summary_A\",\n                \"work_summary\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::da0f21f85aefb292e922131e9a325a641129db8a0e28454cc10d9988dc744a7b\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"study_summary_A\",\n                \"work_summary\"\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"atom_id\": \"atom::46fff116fb877592fe07c91f\",\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0098\",\n          \"field_path\": [\n            \"review_planning_B\",\n            \"facet_contributions\"\n          ],\n          \"value\": {\n            \"boundaries\": \"仅针对III期黑色素瘤患者，且为新辅助联合ICI治疗情境；不能直接外推至其他肿瘤类型或单药ICI治疗。\",\n            \"contribution\": \"提供了特定细菌类群（拟杆菌属、瘤胃球菌科）与ICI疗效（客观缓解）及毒性（irAEs严重程度）的具体关联方向和数据支持。\",\n            \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n          },\n          \"role\": \"evidence\",\n          \"origins\": [\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::abeae3f5437f046402745e3d90c12137942e031e6a48cef52cb857f87928ce97\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"review_planning_B\",\n                \"facet_contributions\",\n                \"0\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::6bd724179a28fdc49a9796137c61dc5af3dc79da06a51d29961b4c4029176986\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"review_planning_B\",\n                \"facet_contributions\",\n                \"0\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::da0f21f85aefb292e922131e9a325a641129db8a0e28454cc10d9988dc744a7b\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"review_planning_B\",\n                \"facet_contributions\",\n                \"0\"\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"atom_id\": \"atom::5ba5a4a521ab5b76c9cdd393\",\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0098\",\n          \"field_path\": [\n            \"review_planning_B\",\n            \"facet_contributions\"\n          ],\n          \"value\": {\n            \"boundaries\": \"这是基于观察性关联提出的假设性机制（'suggests that...'），并非经过功能验证的因果机制；需结合其他研究确认其普遍性。\",\n            \"contribution\": \"提出了一个潜在的机制线索：肠道微生物组可能通过影响基线免疫稳态（特别是Tregs的水平）来设定免疫反应的‘阈值’或‘临界点’，从而影响抗肿瘤免疫和irAEs的发生。\",\n            \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n          },\n          \"role\": \"evidence\",\n          \"origins\": [\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::abeae3f5437f046402745e3d90c12137942e031e6a48cef52cb857f87928ce97\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"review_planning_B\",\n                \"facet_contributions\",\n                \"1\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::6bd724179a28fdc49a9796137c61dc5af3dc79da06a51d29961b4c4029176986\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"review_planning_B\",\n                \"facet_contributions\",\n                \"1\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::da0f21f85aefb292e922131e9a325a641129db8a0e28454cc10d9988dc744a7b\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"review_planning_B\",\n                \"facet_contributions\",\n                \"1\"\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"atom_id\": \"atom::bed1c5a92a1c909e5a7e55ec\",\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0098\",\n          \"field_path\": [\n            \"review_planning_B\",\n            \"broader_review_uses\"\n          ],\n          \"value\": {\n            \"material\": \"摘要中提到‘how gut microbes interact with the immune system... remains unclear’，反映了该领域的知识空白和研究动机。\"\n          },\n          \"role\": \"evidence\",\n          \"origins\": [\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::abeae3f5437f046402745e3d90c12137942e031e6a48cef52cb857f87928ce97\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"review_planning_B\",\n                \"broader_review_uses\",\n                \"0\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::6bd724179a28fdc49a9796137c61dc5af3dc79da06a51d29961b4c4029176986\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"review_planning_B\",\n                \"broader_review_uses\",\n                \"0\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::da0f21f85aefb292e922131e9a325a641129db8a0e28454cc10d9988dc744a7b\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"review_planning_B\",\n                \"broader_review_uses\",\n                \"0\"\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"atom_id\": \"atom::5fb91d23ecba19c99dc65b1b\",\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0098\",\n          \"field_path\": [\n            \"review_planning_B\",\n            \"broader_review_uses\"\n          ],\n          \"value\": {\n            \"material\": \"拟杆菌属既与Treg减少（通常关联疗效）相关，又与严重irAEs相关；而瘤胃球菌科则显示保护性。\"\n          },\n          \"role\": \"evidence\",\n          \"origins\": [\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::abeae3f5437f046402745e3d90c12137942e031e6a48cef52cb857f87928ce97\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"review_planning_B\",\n                \"broader_review_uses\",\n                \"1\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::6bd724179a28fdc49a9796137c61dc5af3dc79da06a51d29961b4c4029176986\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"review_planning_B\",\n                \"broader_review_uses\",\n                \"1\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::da0f21f85aefb292e922131e9a325a641129db8a0e28454cc10d9988dc744a7b\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"review_planning_B\",\n                \"broader_review_uses\",\n                \"1\"\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"atom_id\": \"atom::561b8cc96f7980e0b68fb9a2\",\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0098\",\n          \"field_path\": [\n            \"review_planning_B\",\n            \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n          ],\n          \"value\": \"该研究为会议摘要，详细的方法学细节（如测序深度、生物信息学流程、流式抗体面板、统计分析模型）未在摘要中提供，需谨慎引用具体数值和方法论细节。\",\n          \"role\": \"evidence\",\n          \"origins\": [\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::abeae3f5437f046402745e3d90c12137942e031e6a48cef52cb857f87928ce97\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"review_planning_B\",\n                \"scope_interpretation_cautions\",\n                \"0\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::6bd724179a28fdc49a9796137c61dc5af3dc79da06a51d29961b4c4029176986\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"review_planning_B\",\n                \"scope_interpretation_cautions\",\n                \"0\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::da0f21f85aefb292e922131e9a325a641129db8a0e28454cc10d9988dc744a7b\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"review_planning_B\",\n                \"scope_interpretation_cautions\",\n                \"0\"\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"atom_id\": \"atom::e79b3405bb023182accfa755\",\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0098\",\n          \"field_path\": [\n            \"review_planning_B\",\n            \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n          ],\n          \"value\": \"研究对象仅限于III期黑色素瘤患者，且接受的是新辅助联合ICI治疗，结果可能不适用于晚期转移性黑色素瘤或其他实体瘤的单药ICI治疗。\",\n          \"role\": \"evidence\",\n          \"origins\": [\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::abeae3f5437f046402745e3d90c12137942e031e6a48cef52cb857f87928ce97\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"review_planning_B\",\n                \"scope_interpretation_cautions\",\n                \"1\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::6bd724179a28fdc49a9796137c61dc5af3dc79da06a51d29961b4c4029176986\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"review_planning_B\",\n                \"scope_interpretation_cautions\",\n                \"1\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::da0f21f85aefb292e922131e9a325a641129db8a0e28454cc10d9988dc744a7b\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"review_planning_B\",\n                \"scope_interpretation_cautions\",\n                \"1\"\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"atom_id\": \"atom::fee2de282937a619aa2bdca1\",\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0098\",\n          \"field_path\": [\n            \"review_planning_B\",\n            \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n          ],\n          \"value\": \"关联不等于因果：观察到的微生物与免疫细胞及临床结局的关联可能是由其他未测量的混杂因素驱动的，或反映的是反向因果关系。\",\n          \"role\": \"evidence\",\n          \"origins\": [\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::abeae3f5437f046402745e3d90c12137942e031e6a48cef52cb857f87928ce97\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"review_planning_B\",\n                \"scope_interpretation_cautions\",\n                \"2\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::6bd724179a28fdc49a9796137c61dc5af3dc79da06a51d29961b4c4029176986\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"review_planning_B\",\n                \"scope_interpretation_cautions\",\n                \"2\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::da0f21f85aefb292e922131e9a325a641129db8a0e28454cc10d9988dc744a7b\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"review_planning_B\",\n                \"scope_interpretation_cautions\",\n                \"2\"\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"atom_id\": \"atom::7929958b24e5e4211328f19b\",\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0098\",\n          \"field_path\": [\n            \"review_planning_B\",\n            \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n          ],\n          \"value\": \"‘拟杆菌属’是一个属水平的分类单元，其内部物种可能存在功能差异，摘要未提供更精细的分类或功能信息。\",\n          \"role\": \"evidence\",\n          \"origins\": [\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::abeae3f5437f046402745e3d90c12137942e031e6a48cef52cb857f87928ce97\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"review_planning_B\",\n                \"scope_interpretation_cautions\",\n                \"3\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::6bd724179a28fdc49a9796137c61dc5af3dc79da06a51d29961b4c4029176986\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"review_planning_B\",\n                \"scope_interpretation_cautions\",\n                \"3\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::da0f21f85aefb292e922131e9a325a641129db8a0e28454cc10d9988dc744a7b\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"review_planning_B\",\n                \"scope_interpretation_cautions\",\n                \"3\"\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"atom_id\": \"atom::8e1908b8bbd498777e918ecb\",\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0098\",\n          \"field_path\": [\n            \"card_material\"\n          ],\n          \"value\": {\n            \"known_gaps\": [\n              {\n                \"kind\": \"identity\",\n                \"reason\": \"source identity was not independently verified\",\n                \"status\": \"input_attributed\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"kind\": \"coverage\",\n                \"reason\": \"no complete research body was indexed\",\n                \"status\": \"partial\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"kind\": \"coverage\",\n                \"reason\": \"only abstract or non-title snippets were available\",\n                \"status\": \"partial\"\n              }\n            ],\n            \"material_scope\": \"abstract_only\"\n          },\n          \"role\": \"evidence\",\n          \"origins\": [\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::abeae3f5437f046402745e3d90c12137942e031e6a48cef52cb857f87928ce97\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"card_material\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::6bd724179a28fdc49a9796137c61dc5af3dc79da06a51d29961b4c4029176986\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"card_material\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::da0f21f85aefb292e922131e9a325a641129db8a0e28454cc10d9988dc744a7b\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"card_material\"\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      ],\n      \"scientific_records\": [\n        {\n          \"record_id\": \"record::abeae3f5437f046402745e3d90c12137942e031e6a48cef52cb857f87928ce97\",\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0098\",\n          \"atom_ids\": [\n            \"atom::b67c869eee5a32d72d756c1f\",\n            \"atom::905a16b1317dae09553557fb\",\n            \"atom::4fc1b23aa9738aec8d869909\",\n            \"atom::ddc7133862b1e98dee7bbcc4\",\n            \"atom::5ced063ef4d895bb2527ef3c\",\n            \"atom::df0c22db80cc042e49db6078\",\n            \"atom::155a4a53fa9c96215b2c32fe\",\n            \"atom::4dd917c890edeb09e25c7941\",\n            \"atom::43564e4cabb74c63d54ecf12\",\n            \"atom::13b30b98ec45be93bfcf01d5\",\n            \"atom::b52da9c89aaeaaa5b0749b6e\",\n            \"atom::15613d5b09de0b9d50378597\",\n            \"atom::35e128a47c0a17f95654887c\",\n            \"atom::46fff116fb877592fe07c91f\",\n            \"atom::5ba5a4a521ab5b76c9cdd393\",\n            \"atom::bed1c5a92a1c909e5a7e55ec\",\n            \"atom::5fb91d23ecba19c99dc65b1b\",\n            \"atom::561b8cc96f7980e0b68fb9a2\",\n            \"atom::e79b3405bb023182accfa755\",\n            \"atom::fee2de282937a619aa2bdca1\",\n            \"atom::7929958b24e5e4211328f19b\",\n            \"atom::8e1908b8bbd498777e918ecb\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"record_id\": \"record::6bd724179a28fdc49a9796137c61dc5af3dc79da06a51d29961b4c4029176986\",\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0098\",\n          \"atom_ids\": [\n            \"atom::b67c869eee5a32d72d756c1f\",\n            \"atom::905a16b1317dae09553557fb\",\n            \"atom::4fc1b23aa9738aec8d869909\",\n            \"atom::ddc7133862b1e98dee7bbcc4\",\n            \"atom::5ced063ef4d895bb2527ef3c\",\n            \"atom::df0c22db80cc042e49db6078\",\n            \"atom::155a4a53fa9c96215b2c32fe\",\n            \"atom::4dd917c890edeb09e25c7941\",\n            \"atom::43564e4cabb74c63d54ecf12\",\n            \"atom::13b30b98ec45be93bfcf01d5\",\n            \"atom::b52da9c89aaeaaa5b0749b6e\",\n            \"atom::15613d5b09de0b9d50378597\",\n            \"atom::35e128a47c0a17f95654887c\",\n            \"atom::46fff116fb877592fe07c91f\",\n            \"atom::5ba5a4a521ab5b76c9cdd393\",\n            \"atom::bed1c5a92a1c909e5a7e55ec\",\n            \"atom::5fb91d23ecba19c99dc65b1b\",\n            \"atom::561b8cc96f7980e0b68fb9a2\",\n            \"atom::e79b3405bb023182accfa755\",\n            \"atom::fee2de282937a619aa2bdca1\",\n            \"atom::7929958b24e5e4211328f19b\",\n            \"atom::8e1908b8bbd498777e918ecb\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"record_id\": \"record::da0f21f85aefb292e922131e9a325a641129db8a0e28454cc10d9988dc744a7b\",\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0098\",\n          \"atom_ids\": [\n            \"atom::b67c869eee5a32d72d756c1f\",\n            \"atom::905a16b1317dae09553557fb\",\n            \"atom::4fc1b23aa9738aec8d869909\",\n            \"atom::ddc7133862b1e98dee7bbcc4\",\n            \"atom::5ced063ef4d895bb2527ef3c\",\n            \"atom::df0c22db80cc042e49db6078\",\n            \"atom::155a4a53fa9c96215b2c32fe\",\n            \"atom::4dd917c890edeb09e25c7941\",\n            \"atom::43564e4cabb74c63d54ecf12\",\n            \"atom::13b30b98ec45be93bfcf01d5\",\n            \"atom::b52da9c89aaeaaa5b0749b6e\",\n            \"atom::15613d5b09de0b9d50378597\",\n            \"atom::35e128a47c0a17f95654887c\",\n            \"atom::46fff116fb877592fe07c91f\",\n            \"atom::5ba5a4a521ab5b76c9cdd393\",\n            \"atom::bed1c5a92a1c909e5a7e55ec\",\n            \"atom::5fb91d23ecba19c99dc65b1b\",\n            \"atom::561b8cc96f7980e0b68fb9a2\",\n            \"atom::e79b3405bb023182accfa755\",\n            \"atom::fee2de282937a619aa2bdca1\",\n            \"atom::7929958b24e5e4211328f19b\",\n            \"atom::8e1908b8bbd498777e918ecb\"\n          ]\n        }\n      ],\n      \"review_source_handles\": [],\n      \"packet_sha256\": \"65d863254c7825397876131fb33e149d606823e1757c629d9a6a775940004101\",\n      \"need_ids\": [\n        \"N1\"\n      ],\n      \"questions\": [\n        \"Inspect original guide against linked intact evidence.\"\n      ],\n      \"reread_reasons\": [\n        null\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"packet_kind\": \"source\",\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0593\",\n      \"source_identity\": {\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0593\",\n        \"source_id\": \"source::P0593\",\n        \"aliases\": [],\n        \"title\": \"Single-cell-based identification of drug synergy with immunotherapy via tumor microenvironment remodeling\",\n        \"doi\": \"10.1136/jitc-2025-014132\",\n        \"paper_id\": \"CorpusId:286644045\",\n        \"year\": \"2026\",\n        \"canonical_paper_id\": null\n      },\n      \"evidence_atoms\": [\n        {\n          \"atom_id\": \"atom::f268dc5a31e6509082426a96\",\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0593\",\n          \"field_path\": [\n            \"material_depth\"\n          ],\n          \"value\": \"fulltext\",\n          \"role\": \"evidence\",\n          \"origins\": [\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::253f9e6877830f43e32548d1663b5d3343f4b8c35ed536798a8e99b0b962a5b6\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"material_depth\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::8c09d88d34c8b87066266283c6e58d8031bb531370543c22499a0748f0559fc2\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"material_depth\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::4f1fac3cb1126bd412aa5f23d6fa9f53374fe76c4899ab6c911fa5ffaed6b231\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"material_depth\"\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"atom_id\": \"atom::915832e3eeeb6c7bf46b4dc7\",\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0593\",\n          \"field_path\": [\n            \"material_status\"\n          ],\n          \"value\": \"resolved\",\n          \"role\": \"evidence\",\n          \"origins\": [\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::253f9e6877830f43e32548d1663b5d3343f4b8c35ed536798a8e99b0b962a5b6\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"material_status\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::8c09d88d34c8b87066266283c6e58d8031bb531370543c22499a0748f0559fc2\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"material_status\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::4f1fac3cb1126bd412aa5f23d6fa9f53374fe76c4899ab6c911fa5ffaed6b231\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"material_status\"\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"atom_id\": \"atom::0c9458faeedb93aae1481ce2\",\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0593\",\n          \"field_path\": [\n            \"study_summary_A\",\n            \"approach\"\n          ],\n          \"value\": \"研究采用多步骤计算与实验结合的策略：1) 利用TCGA bulk RNA-seq数据和ImmuCellAI去卷积算法，鉴定与免疫浸润负相关或正相关的TIIMGs；2) 使用L1000高通量筛选平台，针对TIIMGs筛选739种化合物的转录组扰动效应，并通过drug-to-cell recall验证；3) 在CT26小鼠模型中进行体内给药，收集肿瘤组织进行scRNA-seq，利用NMF算法从肿瘤细胞中提取异质性程序并聚类为12个MPs；4) 开发MP评分算法（结合Cluster 1激活与Cluster 2抑制的加权）量化TME重塑程度；5) 基于MP评分优先选择候选药物（oxypurinol及其前体allopurinol），通过流式细胞术、LC-MS/MS检测肌苷水平、体外共培养及体内协同实验验证机制；6) 回顾性分析人类膀胱癌患者队列中抗痛风药与抗PD-1治疗的生存关联。\",\n          \"role\": \"evidence\",\n          \"origins\": [\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::253f9e6877830f43e32548d1663b5d3343f4b8c35ed536798a8e99b0b962a5b6\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"study_summary_A\",\n                \"approach\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::8c09d88d34c8b87066266283c6e58d8031bb531370543c22499a0748f0559fc2\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"study_summary_A\",\n                \"approach\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::4f1fac3cb1126bd412aa5f23d6fa9f53374fe76c4899ab6c911fa5ffaed6b231\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"study_summary_A\",\n                \"approach\"\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"atom_id\": \"atom::894b59684f5f72f52dd6cd62\",\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0593\",\n          \"field_path\": [\n            \"study_summary_A\",\n            \"contribution_and_limits\"\n          ],\n          \"value\": {\n            \"contribution\": \"建立了首个基于单细胞分辨率的药物诱导TME重塑量化框架（resTMe），定义了12个TME元程序（MPs）和MP评分算法，为预测药物-免疫疗法协同作用提供了新工具。\",\n            \"limits\": \"核心scRNA-seq数据仅来源于小鼠模型（CT26），缺乏人源类器官或PDX模型的直接验证，限制了框架在人类复杂TME中的直接外推性。\"\n          },\n          \"role\": \"evidence\",\n          \"origins\": [\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::253f9e6877830f43e32548d1663b5d3343f4b8c35ed536798a8e99b0b962a5b6\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"study_summary_A\",\n                \"contribution_and_limits\",\n                \"0\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::8c09d88d34c8b87066266283c6e58d8031bb531370543c22499a0748f0559fc2\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"study_summary_A\",\n                \"contribution_and_limits\",\n                \"0\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::4f1fac3cb1126bd412aa5f23d6fa9f53374fe76c4899ab6c911fa5ffaed6b231\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"study_summary_A\",\n                \"contribution_and_limits\",\n                \"0\"\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"atom_id\": \"atom::8ef0876af1bde6e00dba83aa\",\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0593\",\n          \"field_path\": [\n            \"study_summary_A\",\n            \"contribution_and_limits\"\n          ],\n          \"value\": {\n            \"contribution\": \"发现了别嘌醇（Allopurinol）作为抗PD-1疗法的潜在增效剂，阐明了其通过嘌呤补救途径增加肌苷分泌、增强肿瘤免疫原性和T细胞功能的分子机制。\",\n            \"limits\": \"机制验证主要在体外细胞系和小鼠模型中进行；人类临床证据仅来自小样本（n=50）、单中心的回顾性观察性研究，存在混杂因素风险，需前瞻性临床试验确认。\"\n          },\n          \"role\": \"evidence\",\n          \"origins\": [\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::253f9e6877830f43e32548d1663b5d3343f4b8c35ed536798a8e99b0b962a5b6\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"study_summary_A\",\n                \"contribution_and_limits\",\n                \"1\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::8c09d88d34c8b87066266283c6e58d8031bb531370543c22499a0748f0559fc2\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"study_summary_A\",\n                \"contribution_and_limits\",\n                \"1\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::4f1fac3cb1126bd412aa5f23d6fa9f53374fe76c4899ab6c911fa5ffaed6b231\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"study_summary_A\",\n                \"contribution_and_limits\",\n                \"1\"\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"atom_id\": \"atom::b30b08eb075f61505bc09741\",\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0593\",\n          \"field_path\": [\n            \"study_summary_A\",\n            \"contribution_and_limits\"\n          ],\n          \"value\": {\n            \"contribution\": \"证实了MDSCs的耗竭是响应性TME的关键标志物，并揭示了低剂量药物可能通过非细胞毒性机制重塑TME以促进免疫浸润。\",\n            \"limits\": \"对于其他候选药物（如epirubicin, vemurafenib）的具体分子机制阐述不如AP深入；不同药物对特定免疫亚群的影响差异较大，尚未形成统一的普适性规则。\"\n          },\n          \"role\": \"evidence\",\n          \"origins\": [\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::253f9e6877830f43e32548d1663b5d3343f4b8c35ed536798a8e99b0b962a5b6\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"study_summary_A\",\n                \"contribution_and_limits\",\n                \"2\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::8c09d88d34c8b87066266283c6e58d8031bb531370543c22499a0748f0559fc2\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"study_summary_A\",\n                \"contribution_and_limits\",\n                \"2\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::4f1fac3cb1126bd412aa5f23d6fa9f53374fe76c4899ab6c911fa5ffaed6b231\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"study_summary_A\",\n                \"contribution_and_limits\",\n                \"2\"\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"atom_id\": \"atom::d89ef3a629b3edc8f1d5680d\",\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0593\",\n          \"field_path\": [\n            \"study_summary_A\",\n            \"key_findings\"\n          ],\n          \"value\": {\n            \"conditions\": \"8种癌症类型TCGA数据分析\",\n            \"finding\": \"鉴定出肿瘤细胞特异性免疫浸润调节基因（TIIMGs），其中COAD拥有最多的dpGenes（792个），KIRC最少，揭示了不同癌症间TME调控网络的异质性。\"\n          },\n          \"role\": \"evidence\",\n          \"origins\": [\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::253f9e6877830f43e32548d1663b5d3343f4b8c35ed536798a8e99b0b962a5b6\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"study_summary_A\",\n                \"key_findings\",\n                \"0\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::8c09d88d34c8b87066266283c6e58d8031bb531370543c22499a0748f0559fc2\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"study_summary_A\",\n                \"key_findings\",\n                \"0\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::4f1fac3cb1126bd412aa5f23d6fa9f53374fe76c4899ab6c911fa5ffaed6b231\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"study_summary_A\",\n                \"key_findings\",\n                \"0\"\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"atom_id\": \"atom::f9f47d7274d6ce123558914d\",\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0593\",\n          \"field_path\": [\n            \"study_summary_A\",\n            \"key_findings\"\n          ],\n          \"value\": {\n            \"conditions\": \"L1000平台筛选739种化合物\",\n            \"finding\": \"识别出54种在多癌种中重复出现的候选药物，主要靶向CDKs、HDAC1、PI3K等通路。低剂量处理更倾向于产生非细胞毒性的免疫调节效应，而高剂量常伴随免疫抑制。\"\n          },\n          \"role\": \"evidence\",\n          \"origins\": [\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::253f9e6877830f43e32548d1663b5d3343f4b8c35ed536798a8e99b0b962a5b6\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"study_summary_A\",\n                \"key_findings\",\n                \"1\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::8c09d88d34c8b87066266283c6e58d8031bb531370543c22499a0748f0559fc2\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"study_summary_A\",\n                \"key_findings\",\n                \"1\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::4f1fac3cb1126bd412aa5f23d6fa9f53374fe76c4899ab6c911fa5ffaed6b231\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"study_summary_A\",\n                \"key_findings\",\n                \"1\"\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"atom_id\": \"atom::13b75fe0affb6edd8981d33b\",\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0593\",\n          \"field_path\": [\n            \"study_summary_A\",\n            \"key_findings\"\n          ],\n          \"value\": {\n            \"conditions\": \"CT26小鼠模型scRNA-seq分析\",\n            \"finding\": \"药物处理导致肿瘤细胞比例下降，免疫细胞（特别是巨噬细胞、DCs）浸润增加，但MDSCs显著减少。oxypurinol表现出最强的TME重塑能力，显著降低MDSCs并增加抗原呈递相关细胞。\"\n          },\n          \"role\": \"evidence\",\n          \"origins\": [\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::253f9e6877830f43e32548d1663b5d3343f4b8c35ed536798a8e99b0b962a5b6\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"study_summary_A\",\n                \"key_findings\",\n                \"2\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::8c09d88d34c8b87066266283c6e58d8031bb531370543c22499a0748f0559fc2\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"study_summary_A\",\n                \"key_findings\",\n                \"2\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::4f1fac3cb1126bd412aa5f23d6fa9f53374fe76c4899ab6c911fa5ffaed6b231\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"study_summary_A\",\n                \"key_findings\",\n                \"2\"\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"atom_id\": \"atom::59223824372c97eeae14a917\",\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0593\",\n          \"field_path\": [\n            \"study_summary_A\",\n            \"key_findings\"\n          ],\n          \"value\": {\n            \"conditions\": \"MP评分算法应用\",\n            \"finding\": \"定义了12个MPs，其中Cluster 2（含MPs 1,3,6,8,10,12）与抗原加工和呈递通路高度相关。oxypurinol获得最高MP评分，提示其具有最强的TME重塑潜力。\"\n          },\n          \"role\": \"evidence\",\n          \"origins\": [\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::253f9e6877830f43e32548d1663b5d3343f4b8c35ed536798a8e99b0b962a5b6\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"study_summary_A\",\n                \"key_findings\",\n                \"3\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::8c09d88d34c8b87066266283c6e58d8031bb531370543c22499a0748f0559fc2\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"study_summary_A\",\n                \"key_findings\",\n                \"3\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::4f1fac3cb1126bd412aa5f23d6fa9f53374fe76c4899ab6c911fa5ffaed6b231\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"study_summary_A\",\n                \"key_findings\",\n                \"3\"\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"atom_id\": \"atom::4f486a10e036032c79861cfc\",\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0593\",\n          \"field_path\": [\n            \"study_summary_A\",\n            \"key_findings\"\n          ],\n          \"value\": {\n            \"conditions\": \"Allopurinol (AP) 联合抗PD-1治疗\",\n            \"finding\": \"AP通过抑制黄嘌呤脱氢酶（XDH）增加肌苷合成并分泌至胞外，肌苷上调肿瘤细胞MHC I类和PD-L1表达，增强CD8+ T细胞介导的细胞毒性。在CT26模型中，AP联合抗PD-1实现4/6小鼠完全治愈。\"\n          },\n          \"role\": \"evidence\",\n          \"origins\": [\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::253f9e6877830f43e32548d1663b5d3343f4b8c35ed536798a8e99b0b962a5b6\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"study_summary_A\",\n                \"key_findings\",\n                \"4\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::8c09d88d34c8b87066266283c6e58d8031bb531370543c22499a0748f0559fc2\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"study_summary_A\",\n                \"key_findings\",\n                \"4\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::4f1fac3cb1126bd412aa5f23d6fa9f53374fe76c4899ab6c911fa5ffaed6b231\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"study_summary_A\",\n                \"key_findings\",\n                \"4\"\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"atom_id\": \"atom::c5b36a5dbcaf7631b8b07425\",\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0593\",\n          \"field_path\": [\n            \"study_summary_A\",\n            \"key_findings\"\n          ],\n          \"value\": {\n            \"conditions\": \"人类膀胱癌回顾性队列（n=50）\",\n            \"finding\": \"在接受抗PD-1治疗的膀胱癌患者中，同时服用抗痛风药物（如AP或febuxostat）的患者组（n=7）的总生存期（OS）显著优于未服用组（n=43）。\"\n          },\n          \"role\": \"evidence\",\n          \"origins\": [\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::253f9e6877830f43e32548d1663b5d3343f4b8c35ed536798a8e99b0b962a5b6\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"study_summary_A\",\n                \"key_findings\",\n                \"5\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::8c09d88d34c8b87066266283c6e58d8031bb531370543c22499a0748f0559fc2\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"study_summary_A\",\n                \"key_findings\",\n                \"5\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::4f1fac3cb1126bd412aa5f23d6fa9f53374fe76c4899ab6c911fa5ffaed6b231\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"study_summary_A\",\n                \"key_findings\",\n                \"5\"\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"atom_id\": \"atom::4a9ba68194211f72c5ff2998\",\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0593\",\n          \"field_path\": [\n            \"study_summary_A\",\n            \"paper_kind\"\n          ],\n          \"value\": \"empirical\",\n          \"role\": \"evidence\",\n          \"origins\": [\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::253f9e6877830f43e32548d1663b5d3343f4b8c35ed536798a8e99b0b962a5b6\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"study_summary_A\",\n                \"paper_kind\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::8c09d88d34c8b87066266283c6e58d8031bb531370543c22499a0748f0559fc2\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"study_summary_A\",\n                \"paper_kind\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::4f1fac3cb1126bd412aa5f23d6fa9f53374fe76c4899ab6c911fa5ffaed6b231\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"study_summary_A\",\n                \"paper_kind\"\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"atom_id\": \"atom::309f1460bfa5781083656af4\",\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0593\",\n          \"field_path\": [\n            \"study_summary_A\",\n            \"problem_or_question\"\n          ],\n          \"value\": \"如何在复杂的肿瘤微环境中系统性地识别能够增强免疫疗法疗效的药物组合？目前缺乏量化药物诱导TME重塑的系统框架，且难以预测哪些非抗癌药物可作为免疫治疗的增效剂。\",\n          \"role\": \"evidence\",\n          \"origins\": [\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::253f9e6877830f43e32548d1663b5d3343f4b8c35ed536798a8e99b0b962a5b6\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"study_summary_A\",\n                \"problem_or_question\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::8c09d88d34c8b87066266283c6e58d8031bb531370543c22499a0748f0559fc2\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"study_summary_A\",\n                \"problem_or_question\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::4f1fac3cb1126bd412aa5f23d6fa9f53374fe76c4899ab6c911fa5ffaed6b231\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"study_summary_A\",\n                \"problem_or_question\"\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"atom_id\": \"atom::732cd6b3522e68e0af8deae5\",\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0593\",\n          \"field_path\": [\n            \"study_summary_A\",\n            \"research_scope\"\n          ],\n          \"value\": \"研究聚焦于实体瘤（以小鼠结肠癌CT26模型和人类膀胱癌队列为主）的肿瘤微环境（TME），探讨药物诱导的TME重塑如何影响免疫检查点抑制剂（如抗PD-1/PD-L1）的疗效。研究对象包括8种癌症类型的TCGA数据、739种免疫调节化合物、小鼠体内的单细胞转录组数据以及临床回顾性队列。\",\n          \"role\": \"evidence\",\n          \"origins\": [\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::253f9e6877830f43e32548d1663b5d3343f4b8c35ed536798a8e99b0b962a5b6\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"study_summary_A\",\n                \"research_scope\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::8c09d88d34c8b87066266283c6e58d8031bb531370543c22499a0748f0559fc2\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"study_summary_A\",\n                \"research_scope\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::4f1fac3cb1126bd412aa5f23d6fa9f53374fe76c4899ab6c911fa5ffaed6b231\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"study_summary_A\",\n                \"research_scope\"\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"atom_id\": \"atom::82ddeb3927993c2d17aa2d61\",\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0593\",\n          \"field_path\": [\n            \"study_summary_A\",\n            \"work_summary\"\n          ],\n          \"value\": \"该研究旨在解决缺乏系统性框架来量化药物诱导的TME重塑的问题。作者首先通过TCGA数据和ImmuCellAI算法鉴定了肿瘤细胞特异性免疫浸润调节基因（TIIMGs），并利用L1000平台筛选出能显著调控这些基因的化合物。随后，在小鼠CT26肿瘤模型中，通过单细胞RNA测序（scRNA-seq）分析了多种药物处理后的TME变化，识别出12个与TME重塑相关的元程序（Meta-programs, MPs）。基于MP富集情况开发了MP评分算法，用于量化TME对药物的响应程度。该算法成功鉴定出别嘌醇（Allopurinol, AP），一种痛风药物，发现其能通过促进肌苷（inosine）的合成与分泌，上调肿瘤细胞的MHC I类和PD-L1表达，从而增强CD8+ T细胞的杀伤活性。在体内实验中，低剂量AP联合抗PD-1治疗实现了4/6的小鼠完全肿瘤清除。此外，一项包含50名膀胱癌患者的回顾性研究显示，接受抗痛风药物治疗的患者在抗PD-1治疗下的总生存期显著优于未使用者。\",\n          \"role\": \"evidence\",\n          \"origins\": [\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::253f9e6877830f43e32548d1663b5d3343f4b8c35ed536798a8e99b0b962a5b6\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"study_summary_A\",\n                \"work_summary\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::8c09d88d34c8b87066266283c6e58d8031bb531370543c22499a0748f0559fc2\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"study_summary_A\",\n                \"work_summary\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::4f1fac3cb1126bd412aa5f23d6fa9f53374fe76c4899ab6c911fa5ffaed6b231\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"study_summary_A\",\n                \"work_summary\"\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"atom_id\": \"atom::29799ff01275a5961dfa4b1f\",\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0593\",\n          \"field_path\": [\n            \"review_planning_B\",\n            \"facet_contributions\"\n          ],\n          \"value\": {\n            \"boundaries\": \"该研究未涉及肠道菌群，因此不能直接回答菌群如何调制ICI疗效的问题，只能作为平行机制或交互作用的潜在背景。\",\n            \"contribution\": \"提供了非微生物来源的代谢物（肌苷）增强ICI疗效的证据。研究发现别嘌醇通过增加肌苷分泌，增强CD8+ T细胞功能，这与某些肠道菌群代谢产物（如丁酸盐、次级胆汁酸）调节免疫微环境的机制形成互补或对比视角。\",\n            \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n          },\n          \"role\": \"evidence\",\n          \"origins\": [\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::253f9e6877830f43e32548d1663b5d3343f4b8c35ed536798a8e99b0b962a5b6\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"review_planning_B\",\n                \"facet_contributions\",\n                \"0\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::8c09d88d34c8b87066266283c6e58d8031bb531370543c22499a0748f0559fc2\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"review_planning_B\",\n                \"facet_contributions\",\n                \"0\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::4f1fac3cb1126bd412aa5f23d6fa9f53374fe76c4899ab6c911fa5ffaed6b231\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"review_planning_B\",\n                \"facet_contributions\",\n                \"0\"\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"atom_id\": \"atom::cc0bd417229ac67f8358b8ee\",\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0593\",\n          \"field_path\": [\n            \"review_planning_B\",\n            \"facet_contributions\"\n          ],\n          \"value\": {\n            \"boundaries\": \"机制仅限于别嘌醇-肌苷轴，不能推广为所有ICI增效剂的通用机制。人类证据仅为相关性，因果链条在人体中尚待确证。\",\n            \"contribution\": \"详细阐述了别嘌醇增强ICI疗效的具体分子机制：抑制XDH -> 增加肌苷 -> 上调MHC I/PD-L1 -> 增强T细胞杀伤。同时指出MDSCs减少是响应性TME的标志。\",\n            \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n          },\n          \"role\": \"evidence\",\n          \"origins\": [\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::253f9e6877830f43e32548d1663b5d3343f4b8c35ed536798a8e99b0b962a5b6\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"review_planning_B\",\n                \"facet_contributions\",\n                \"1\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::8c09d88d34c8b87066266283c6e58d8031bb531370543c22499a0748f0559fc2\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"review_planning_B\",\n                \"facet_contributions\",\n                \"1\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::4f1fac3cb1126bd412aa5f23d6fa9f53374fe76c4899ab6c911fa5ffaed6b231\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"review_planning_B\",\n                \"facet_contributions\",\n                \"1\"\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"atom_id\": \"atom::ce5af135f0f54a3f33ded5af\",\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0593\",\n          \"field_path\": [\n            \"review_planning_B\",\n            \"facet_contributions\"\n          ],\n          \"value\": {\n            \"boundaries\": \"基于小鼠模型数据，人类组织中MDSCs的功能异质性更大，需谨慎外推。\",\n            \"contribution\": \"提供了MDSCs耗竭作为ICI响应生物标志物的实证支持。在scRNA-seq分析中，响应性TME显著特征为MDSCs比例降低。\",\n            \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n          },\n          \"role\": \"evidence\",\n          \"origins\": [\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::253f9e6877830f43e32548d1663b5d3343f4b8c35ed536798a8e99b0b962a5b6\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"review_planning_B\",\n                \"facet_contributions\",\n                \"2\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::8c09d88d34c8b87066266283c6e58d8031bb531370543c22499a0748f0559fc2\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"review_planning_B\",\n                \"facet_contributions\",\n                \"2\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::4f1fac3cb1126bd412aa5f23d6fa9f53374fe76c4899ab6c911fa5ffaed6b231\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"review_planning_B\",\n                \"facet_contributions\",\n                \"2\"\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"atom_id\": \"atom::911473103290b79cdeaaf990\",\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0593\",\n          \"field_path\": [\n            \"review_planning_B\",\n            \"broader_review_uses\"\n          ],\n          \"value\": {\n            \"material\": \"别嘌醇（痛风药）被鉴定为抗PD-1增效剂，并在回顾性临床队列中显示生存获益。\"\n          },\n          \"role\": \"evidence\",\n          \"origins\": [\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::253f9e6877830f43e32548d1663b5d3343f4b8c35ed536798a8e99b0b962a5b6\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"review_planning_B\",\n                \"broader_review_uses\",\n                \"0\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::8c09d88d34c8b87066266283c6e58d8031bb531370543c22499a0748f0559fc2\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"review_planning_B\",\n                \"broader_review_uses\",\n                \"0\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::4f1fac3cb1126bd412aa5f23d6fa9f53374fe76c4899ab6c911fa5ffaed6b231\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"review_planning_B\",\n                \"broader_review_uses\",\n                \"0\"\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"atom_id\": \"atom::d608d3703ed2d823c7784427\",\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0593\",\n          \"field_path\": [\n            \"review_planning_B\",\n            \"broader_review_uses\"\n          ],\n          \"value\": {\n            \"material\": \"MP评分算法和12个元程序的定义，量化了抗原呈递、盐应激反应等生物学过程在药物处理后的变化。\"\n          },\n          \"role\": \"evidence\",\n          \"origins\": [\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::253f9e6877830f43e32548d1663b5d3343f4b8c35ed536798a8e99b0b962a5b6\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"review_planning_B\",\n                \"broader_review_uses\",\n                \"1\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::8c09d88d34c8b87066266283c6e58d8031bb531370543c22499a0748f0559fc2\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"review_planning_B\",\n                \"broader_review_uses\",\n                \"1\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::4f1fac3cb1126bd412aa5f23d6fa9f53374fe76c4899ab6c911fa5ffaed6b231\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"review_planning_B\",\n                \"broader_review_uses\",\n                \"1\"\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"atom_id\": \"atom::1c11e7ad8dda921d2c87e471\",\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0593\",\n          \"field_path\": [\n            \"review_planning_B\",\n            \"broader_review_uses\"\n          ],\n          \"value\": {\n            \"material\": \"AP处理导致肌苷大量分泌，增强OT-I T细胞对B16-OVA肿瘤的杀伤力。\"\n          },\n          \"role\": \"evidence\",\n          \"origins\": [\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::253f9e6877830f43e32548d1663b5d3343f4b8c35ed536798a8e99b0b962a5b6\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"review_planning_B\",\n                \"broader_review_uses\",\n                \"2\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::8c09d88d34c8b87066266283c6e58d8031bb531370543c22499a0748f0559fc2\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"review_planning_B\",\n                \"broader_review_uses\",\n                \"2\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::4f1fac3cb1126bd412aa5f23d6fa9f53374fe76c4899ab6c911fa5ffaed6b231\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"review_planning_B\",\n                \"broader_review_uses\",\n                \"2\"\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"atom_id\": \"atom::9a50fe6e4b2c8671f940ffb9\",\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0593\",\n          \"field_path\": [\n            \"review_planning_B\",\n            \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n          ],\n          \"value\": \"该研究的核心对象是小鼠模型和人类膀胱癌回顾性队列，未直接研究肠道菌群。在将其用于回答‘菌群如何调制ICI’问题时，必须明确其作为‘非菌群代谢机制’的对比或补充角色，而非直接证据。\",\n          \"role\": \"evidence\",\n          \"origins\": [\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::253f9e6877830f43e32548d1663b5d3343f4b8c35ed536798a8e99b0b962a5b6\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"review_planning_B\",\n                \"scope_interpretation_cautions\",\n                \"0\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::8c09d88d34c8b87066266283c6e58d8031bb531370543c22499a0748f0559fc2\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"review_planning_B\",\n                \"scope_interpretation_cautions\",\n                \"0\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::4f1fac3cb1126bd412aa5f23d6fa9f53374fe76c4899ab6c911fa5ffaed6b231\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"review_planning_B\",\n                \"scope_interpretation_cautions\",\n                \"0\"\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"atom_id\": \"atom::78212dc609fe90c3f037d637\",\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0593\",\n          \"field_path\": [\n            \"review_planning_B\",\n            \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n          ],\n          \"value\": \"人类临床数据仅为小样本回顾性观察（n=50），存在选择偏倚和混杂因素，不能作为因果关系的确凿证据，仅能作为假设生成的线索。\",\n          \"role\": \"evidence\",\n          \"origins\": [\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::253f9e6877830f43e32548d1663b5d3343f4b8c35ed536798a8e99b0b962a5b6\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"review_planning_B\",\n                \"scope_interpretation_cautions\",\n                \"1\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::8c09d88d34c8b87066266283c6e58d8031bb531370543c22499a0748f0559fc2\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"review_planning_B\",\n                \"scope_interpretation_cautions\",\n                \"1\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::4f1fac3cb1126bd412aa5f23d6fa9f53374fe76c4899ab6c911fa5ffaed6b231\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"review_planning_B\",\n                \"scope_interpretation_cautions\",\n                \"1\"\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"atom_id\": \"atom::125505f32ce06e79d94ca2a2\",\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0593\",\n          \"field_path\": [\n            \"review_planning_B\",\n            \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n          ],\n          \"value\": \"别嘌醇的机制特异性强（肌苷轴），不能将其效果泛化为所有代谢调节药物或所有ICI增效剂的共同机制。\",\n          \"role\": \"evidence\",\n          \"origins\": [\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::253f9e6877830f43e32548d1663b5d3343f4b8c35ed536798a8e99b0b962a5b6\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"review_planning_B\",\n                \"scope_interpretation_cautions\",\n                \"2\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::8c09d88d34c8b87066266283c6e58d8031bb531370543c22499a0748f0559fc2\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"review_planning_B\",\n                \"scope_interpretation_cautions\",\n                \"2\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::4f1fac3cb1126bd412aa5f23d6fa9f53374fe76c4899ab6c911fa5ffaed6b231\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"review_planning_B\",\n                \"scope_interpretation_cautions\",\n                \"2\"\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"atom_id\": \"atom::c058dc0771a54f0d89db5a07\",\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0593\",\n          \"field_path\": [\n            \"review_planning_B\",\n            \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n          ],\n          \"value\": \"MP评分和元程序是基于小鼠CT26模型定义的，在不同癌症类型或人源模型中的适用性需进一步验证。\",\n          \"role\": \"evidence\",\n          \"origins\": [\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::253f9e6877830f43e32548d1663b5d3343f4b8c35ed536798a8e99b0b962a5b6\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"review_planning_B\",\n                \"scope_interpretation_cautions\",\n                \"3\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::8c09d88d34c8b87066266283c6e58d8031bb531370543c22499a0748f0559fc2\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"review_planning_B\",\n                \"scope_interpretation_cautions\",\n                \"3\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::4f1fac3cb1126bd412aa5f23d6fa9f53374fe76c4899ab6c911fa5ffaed6b231\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"review_planning_B\",\n                \"scope_interpretation_cautions\",\n                \"3\"\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"atom_id\": \"atom::50e3812052714d3b820c4e72\",\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0593\",\n          \"field_path\": [\n            \"supplement_material\"\n          ],\n          \"value\": {\n            \"auxiliary_material\": \"The study developed a meta-program (MP) scoring algorithm based on scRNA-seq data from mouse tumors to quantify TME remodeling, identifying myeloid-derived suppressor cell (MDSC) depletion as a hallmark of responsive TMEs. It established a resource (scIMD) and web tool (resTMe) for screening immunomodulatory drugs. The analysis covered eight cancer types for gene identification but performed in vivo validation primarily in the CT26 colon carcinoma model.\",\n            \"evidence\": [],\n            \"gap_id\": \"case_C2_inosine_tme\",\n            \"judgment_path\": \"F:\\\\OptoMind-Review-2\\\\outputs\\\\body_full_staged_acceptance_20261004_40cny\\\\planning\\\\level2\\\\external\\\\Nf2f13ca37a1cba78c9d1-acf4314fb7d520c6\\\\round_2\\\\supplements\\\\case_C2_inosine_tme\\\\attempt-h4sdftel\\\\source_units\\\\SU03_search_candidate_7df1939f2d\\\\FULFILLMENT_JUDGMENT.json\",\n            \"limitations\": [],\n            \"material_ready\": true,\n            \"material_usefulness\": \"supporting\",\n            \"outline_action_recovered_by_policy\": false,\n            \"remaining_gap\": \"This material does not provide the absolute physiological concentration of inosine within the human tumor microenvironment (TME); the concentration data reported is from mouse cell culture supernatants. Furthermore, it does not report a direct statistical correlation between measured human TME inosine levels and ICI efficacy (e.g., ORR, PFS, OS). The human clinical evidence provided is an association between gout medication usage (as a proxy for inosine elevation) and survival, not a correlation based on quantified inosine metabolite levels in patient tissues or fluids. The study explicitly notes its limitation that drug scRNA-seq data were derived from mouse models.\",\n            \"remaining_gap_recovered_by_policy\": false,\n            \"status\": \"unmet\",\n            \"useful_material\": \"This study investigated the synergistic effect of allopurinol (AP) with anti-PD-1 therapy. In mouse CT26 cell cultures, LC-MS/MS analysis showed AP treatment increased extracellular inosine levels by approximately 500 to 1000-fold in supernatants, while cell lysate levels remained unchanged, indicating active export. Mechanistically, AP inhibits xanthine dehydrogenase (XDH), elevating hypoxanthine which is converted to inosine via the salvage pathway. In vivo, AP combined with anti-PD-1 achieved tumor-free outcomes in 4/6 mice. In a retrospective human cohort of 50 bladder cancer patients receiving anti-PD-1 therapy, the 7 patients concurrently taking gout medications (AP or febuxostat) showed significantly better overall survival compared to the 43 patients who did not. The authors propose that elevated inosine enhances tumor immunogenicity (upregulating MHC class I and PD-L1) and supports T-cell function.\"\n          },\n          \"role\": \"evidence\",\n          \"origins\": [\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::253f9e6877830f43e32548d1663b5d3343f4b8c35ed536798a8e99b0b962a5b6\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"supplement_material\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::8c09d88d34c8b87066266283c6e58d8031bb531370543c22499a0748f0559fc2\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"supplement_material\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::4f1fac3cb1126bd412aa5f23d6fa9f53374fe76c4899ab6c911fa5ffaed6b231\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"supplement_material\"\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"atom_id\": \"atom::93b0bc69434a90089e6079fe\",\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0593\",\n          \"field_path\": [\n            \"supplement_materials\"\n          ],\n          \"value\": [\n            {\n              \"auxiliary_material\": \"The study developed a meta-program (MP) scoring algorithm based on scRNA-seq data from mouse tumors to quantify TME remodeling, identifying myeloid-derived suppressor cell (MDSC) depletion as a hallmark of responsive TMEs. It established a resource (scIMD) and web tool (resTMe) for screening immunomodulatory drugs. The analysis covered eight cancer types for gene identification but performed in vivo validation primarily in the CT26 colon carcinoma model.\",\n              \"evidence\": [],\n              \"gap_id\": \"case_C2_inosine_tme\",\n              \"judgment_path\": \"F:\\\\OptoMind-Review-2\\\\outputs\\\\body_full_staged_acceptance_20261004_40cny\\\\planning\\\\level2\\\\external\\\\Nf2f13ca37a1cba78c9d1-acf4314fb7d520c6\\\\round_2\\\\supplements\\\\case_C2_inosine_tme\\\\attempt-h4sdftel\\\\source_units\\\\SU03_search_candidate_7df1939f2d\\\\FULFILLMENT_JUDGMENT.json\",\n              \"limitations\": [],\n              \"material_ready\": true,\n              \"material_usefulness\": \"supporting\",\n              \"outline_action_recovered_by_policy\": false,\n              \"remaining_gap\": \"This material does not provide the absolute physiological concentration of inosine within the human tumor microenvironment (TME); the concentration data reported is from mouse cell culture supernatants. Furthermore, it does not report a direct statistical correlation between measured human TME inosine levels and ICI efficacy (e.g., ORR, PFS, OS). The human clinical evidence provided is an association between gout medication usage (as a proxy for inosine elevation) and survival, not a correlation based on quantified inosine metabolite levels in patient tissues or fluids. The study explicitly notes its limitation that drug scRNA-seq data were derived from mouse models.\",\n              \"remaining_gap_recovered_by_policy\": false,\n              \"status\": \"unmet\",\n              \"useful_material\": \"This study investigated the synergistic effect of allopurinol (AP) with anti-PD-1 therapy. In mouse CT26 cell cultures, LC-MS/MS analysis showed AP treatment increased extracellular inosine levels by approximately 500 to 1000-fold in supernatants, while cell lysate levels remained unchanged, indicating active export. Mechanistically, AP inhibits xanthine dehydrogenase (XDH), elevating hypoxanthine which is converted to inosine via the salvage pathway. In vivo, AP combined with anti-PD-1 achieved tumor-free outcomes in 4/6 mice. In a retrospective human cohort of 50 bladder cancer patients receiving anti-PD-1 therapy, the 7 patients concurrently taking gout medications (AP or febuxostat) showed significantly better overall survival compared to the 43 patients who did not. The authors propose that elevated inosine enhances tumor immunogenicity (upregulating MHC class I and PD-L1) and supports T-cell function.\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"role\": \"evidence\",\n          \"origins\": [\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::253f9e6877830f43e32548d1663b5d3343f4b8c35ed536798a8e99b0b962a5b6\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"supplement_materials\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::8c09d88d34c8b87066266283c6e58d8031bb531370543c22499a0748f0559fc2\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"supplement_materials\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::4f1fac3cb1126bd412aa5f23d6fa9f53374fe76c4899ab6c911fa5ffaed6b231\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"supplement_materials\"\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"atom_id\": \"atom::533541e5da218bf180bf8879\",\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0593\",\n          \"field_path\": [\n            \"card_material\"\n          ],\n          \"value\": {\n            \"known_gaps\": [\n              {\n                \"asset_id\": \"asset-d48cd64bd12b302ad2ba\",\n                \"kind\": \"asset\",\n                \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n                \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"asset_id\": \"asset-95bd9a77b14edf06222c\",\n                \"kind\": \"asset\",\n                \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n                \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"asset_id\": \"asset-a7194a689f46f19f0fc9\",\n                \"kind\": \"asset\",\n                \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n                \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"asset_id\": \"asset-5f82ba52a99d38e52a55\",\n                \"kind\": \"asset\",\n                \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n                \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"asset_id\": \"asset-5bcddf895da96806b16c\",\n                \"kind\": \"asset\",\n                \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n                \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"asset_id\": \"asset-c44cb221036f78d05573\",\n                \"kind\": \"asset\",\n                \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n                \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"kind\": \"assets\",\n                \"missing\": [\n                  \"jitc-14-3-g001.jpg\",\n                  \"jitc-14-3-g002.jpg\",\n                  \"jitc-14-3-g003.jpg\",\n                  \"jitc-14-3-g004.jpg\",\n                  \"jitc-14-3-g005.jpg\",\n                  \"jitc-14-3-g006.jpg\",\n                  \"jitc-14-3-s001.docx\",\n                  \"jitc-14-3-s002.xlsx\",\n                  \"jitc-14-3-s003.xlsx\",\n                  \"jitc-14-3-s004.xlsx\",\n                  \"jitc-14-3-s005.xlsx\",\n                  \"jitc-14-3-s006.xlsx\",\n                  \"jitc-14-3-s007.xlsx\",\n                  \"jitc-14-3-s008.xlsx\",\n                  \"jitc-14-3-s009.xlsx\",\n                  \"jitc-14-3-s010.tif\"\n                ],\n                \"reason\": \"graphic_members_unmatched\",\n                \"status\": \"partial\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"kind\": \"assets\",\n                \"reason\": \"supplementary_bundle_had_no_safe_matching_images\",\n                \"status\": \"unparsed\"\n              }\n            ],\n            \"material_scope\": \"fulltext\"\n          },\n          \"role\": \"evidence\",\n          \"origins\": [\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::253f9e6877830f43e32548d1663b5d3343f4b8c35ed536798a8e99b0b962a5b6\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"card_material\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::8c09d88d34c8b87066266283c6e58d8031bb531370543c22499a0748f0559fc2\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"card_material\"\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"record_id\": \"record::4f1fac3cb1126bd412aa5f23d6fa9f53374fe76c4899ab6c911fa5ffaed6b231\",\n              \"field_path\": [\n                \"card_material\"\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      ],\n      \"scientific_records\": [\n        {\n          \"record_id